(1202082, 151763, 33182, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little too small to see very well, and it doesn''t look very sharp either, it could just be that I''m having a hard time seeing it though.</td>', 'This picture is a little too small to see very well, and it doesn''t look very sharp either, it could just be that I''m having a hard time seeing it though.', '2005-03-02 00:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
