(1202092, 150606, 25232, '<td valign="top">Are you sure that is a poodle and not a bichon? Hair and nose look wrong for a poodle.</td>', 'Are you sure that is a poodle and not a bichon? Hair and nose look wrong for a poodle.', '2005-03-02 00:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202095, 150251, 33182, '<td valign="top">Now you''re taking pictures like me (using toys). I''d try adjusting the "white balance" though. The snow looks more blue than white, also, I can''t really tell where the focus point is.</td>', 'Now you''re taking pictures like me (using toys). I''d try adjusting the "white balance" though. The snow looks more blue than white, also, I can''t really tell where the focus point is.', '2005-03-02 00:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
