(1202252, 150556, 6804, '<td valign="top">WOW, I love the composition here. The back lighting has more interest than just a plain white. The dark rust color is a great look for this, but it is a little darker that I would expect as "light" on white.  I am docking just a little for the dark colors.  The white border is...... just ok, I think you could do without a border at all on this. It takes a little away from the window frame and it''s a little uneven right/left sides.  The over-all shot is really great and well thought out.  8</td>', 'WOW, I love the composition here. The back lighting has more interest than just a plain white. The dark rust color is a great look for this, but it is a little darker that I would expect as "light" on white.  I am docking just a little for the dark colors.  The white border is...... just ok, I think you could do without a border at all on this. It takes a little away from the window frame and it''s a little uneven right/left sides.  The over-all shot is really great and well thought out.  8', '2005-03-02 00:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
