(1202366, 150816, 17507, '<td valign="top">This picture makes no sense at all to me, which is why I like it.<br/>This probably has something to do with the fact that my entry makes no sense either.</td>', 'This picture makes no sense at all to me, which is why I like it.This probably has something to do with the fact that my entry makes no sense either.', '2005-03-02 01:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202367, 151876, 33182, '<td valign="top">Too bad this wasn''t in advanced editing or you could have gotten rid of the slobber. &lt;g&gt;</td>', 'Too bad this wasn''t in advanced editing or you could have gotten rid of the slobber. <g>', '2005-03-02 01:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202370, 150128, 17507, '<td valign="top">His bashful half-grin is adorable :)</td>', 'His bashful half-grin is adorable :)', '2005-03-02 01:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202373, 151480, 33182, '<td valign="top">picture seems a little dark to me.</td>', 'picture seems a little dark to me.', '2005-03-02 01:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202374, 151390, 18367, '<td valign="top">The fence and the snow would have sufficed.  I think your score may suffer due to the presence of several, "non light" items.<br/> <br/>Good photo nonetheless.</td>', 'The fence and the snow would have sufficed.  I think your score may suffer due to the presence of several, "non light" items. Good photo nonetheless.', '2005-03-02 01:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202376, 151834, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject. The bloom itself is in a great crisp focus, and I find myself wishing the stem were also in focus--stop down the camera? Also it might have been worth a try to put a light behind the flower to even out the tones a bit and possibly avoid overexposing the petals at the bottom.</td>', 'Great choice of subject. The bloom itself is in a great crisp focus, and I find myself wishing the stem were also in focus--stop down the camera? Also it might have been worth a try to put a light behind the flower to even out the tones a bit and possibly avoid overexposing the petals at the bottom.', '2005-03-02 01:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202377, 151862, 33182, '<td valign="top">The facial goop just distracts from the picture.</td>', 'The facial goop just distracts from the picture.', '2005-03-02 01:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202378, 151829, 32872, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegant. Very pretty.</td>', 'Simple and elegant. Very pretty.', '2005-03-02 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202379, 150110, 17507, '<td valign="top">What an interesting and weird flower. Wonderful lighting. I really like the gradient in the background--the white to the light grey is pleasingly subtle. Not to be an anti-noise snob, but I think NeatImage would have been helpful. If you don''t have it already, I recommend downloading it (it''s free).</td>', 'What an interesting and weird flower. Wonderful lighting. I really like the gradient in the background--the white to the light grey is pleasingly subtle. Not to be an anti-noise snob, but I think NeatImage would have been helpful. If you don''t have it already, I recommend downloading it (it''s free).', '2005-03-02 01:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202380, 151876, 18367, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.... my favorite to date.  I do believe that once I have completed my prelilminary scoring, I will be back to upgrade this one.  Great capture.</td>', 'Fantastic shot.... my favorite to date.  I do believe that once I have completed my prelilminary scoring, I will be back to upgrade this one.  Great capture.', '2005-03-02 01:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202382, 151370, 32672, '<td valign="top">THis one ought to ribbon.  I see no flaws whatsoever.</td>', 'THis one ought to ribbon.  I see no flaws whatsoever.', '2005-03-02 01:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202386, 151395, 17507, '<td valign="top">If that''s milk, then I am disturbed by its apparently chunky texture :(</td>', 'If that''s milk, then I am disturbed by its apparently chunky texture :(', '2005-03-02 01:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202389, 151860, 17507, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a point that graphicfunk made about any given challenge implying its opposites-- he said something to the effect of: "In a ''Black'' challenge, there is a place for a mostly white photo," though his phrasing was better. Great photo, but questionable border?</td>', 'Reminds me of a point that graphicfunk made about any given challenge implying its opposites-- he said something to the effect of: "In a ''Black'' challenge, there is a place for a mostly white photo," though his phrasing was better. Great photo, but questionable border?', '2005-03-02 01:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202391, 150712, 32872, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot!</td>', 'I really love this shot!', '2005-03-02 01:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1202392, 150618, 33182, '<td valign="top">the picture seems a little yellowish to me.</td>', 'the picture seems a little yellowish to me.', '2005-03-02 01:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
