(1203027, 150159, 33560, '<td valign="top">In this case "Be sure you do over expose your highlights." It''s an interesting shot.  I like how unconventional use of light can transform a solid and boring industrial space into an ethereal one.  But in the end, the space still wins, and it is an ugly space.</td>', 'In this case "Be sure you do over expose your highlights." It''s an interesting shot.  I like how unconventional use of light can transform a solid and boring industrial space into an ethereal one.  But in the end, the space still wins, and it is an ugly space.', '2005-03-02 10:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203031, 150358, 33560, '<td valign="top">At last, a flower that is not over-photographed.  And the arrangement is inspired. Even anticipating that the challenge would be full of mums, roses, and other flowers I did not anticipate these beauties.  Very Nice.</td>', 'At last, a flower that is not over-photographed.  And the arrangement is inspired. Even anticipating that the challenge would be full of mums, roses, and other flowers I did not anticipate these beauties.  Very Nice.', '2005-03-02 10:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
