(1203313, 151685, 33560, '<td valign="top">White bark can be very drammatic, so this was a choice of subject with much aesthetic potential.  Unfortunately the twigs and leaves in this shot are distracting.  Nor do the shapes of these trunks really draw us in - especially since they fail to set up strong leading lines, but rather serve to chop up the negative space.</td>', 'White bark can be very drammatic, so this was a choice of subject with much aesthetic potential.  Unfortunately the twigs and leaves in this shot are distracting.  Nor do the shapes of these trunks really draw us in - especially since they fail to set up strong leading lines, but rather serve to chop up the negative space.', '2005-03-02 13:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
