(1203427, 151862, 32672, '<td valign="top">The tighness of the clothing gives a spare tire effect on the model (see waistline and armpit to right of screen).  Perhaps clothing a size larger that hugged her figure versus pulling and squeezing would have made her figure more attractive.  THe necklace which accentuates the collarbone, and the hat, are nice touches.</td>', 'The tighness of the clothing gives a spare tire effect on the model (see waistline and armpit to right of screen).  Perhaps clothing a size larger that hugged her figure versus pulling and squeezing would have made her figure more attractive.  THe necklace which accentuates the collarbone, and the hat, are nice touches.', '2005-03-02 14:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1203429, 150075, 33435, '<td valign="top">In the future, try to avoid the camera date on the actual picture.  Folks on this site are looking for art, interesting subjects, and quality photos.  You followed the rules of the challenge more so than a lot of others, but try to focus more on interesting subjects.  A photograph of toilet paper rolls is not something I would want to see hanging on a wall.  Know what I mean?  I hope this helps.  I''m not trying to put your picture down, but I''m sure you''re capable of better.</td>', 'In the future, try to avoid the camera date on the actual picture.  Folks on this site are looking for art, interesting subjects, and quality photos.  You followed the rules of the challenge more so than a lot of others, but try to focus more on interesting subjects.  A photograph of toilet paper rolls is not something I would want to see hanging on a wall.  Know what I mean?  I hope this helps.  I''m not trying to put your picture down, but I''m sure you''re capable of better.', '2005-03-02 14:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
