(1203483, 151716, 32672, '<td valign="top">Ha, great title!  I''ve got to say, I''m doing it all wrong with ivory carpeting and three black cats (my himalayan is the only one that leaves an invisible layer of fur on it all!).  Of course, if I wore clothes to match my cat''s average fur color, I''d look sorta goth.  Anyway, cute shot.  I love the eyes and the light creating a silver lining around the egdes of his (her?) frame.  The crossed paws give a very obedient, loyal effect.</td>', 'Ha, great title!  I''ve got to say, I''m doing it all wrong with ivory carpeting and three black cats (my himalayan is the only one that leaves an invisible layer of fur on it all!).  Of course, if I wore clothes to match my cat''s average fur color, I''d look sorta goth.  Anyway, cute shot.  I love the eyes and the light creating a silver lining around the egdes of his (her?) frame.  The crossed paws give a very obedient, loyal effect.', '2005-03-02 14:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
