(1203508, 151394, 27399, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great photo!  The only critique I would make is your reflection in her eyes, which often is seen as a technical error.  Although, in this photo (given the title) it can also have the positive effect showing you as part of her soul, in her soul, part of her, etc.  Or, it gives the viewer the sense that they are looking at her in person.  Either way, good shot!</td>', 'Wow! Great photo!  The only critique I would make is your reflection in her eyes, which often is seen as a technical error.  Although, in this photo (given the title) it can also have the positive effect showing you as part of her soul, in her soul, part of her, etc.  Or, it gives the viewer the sense that they are looking at her in person.  Either way, good shot!', '2005-03-02 14:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
