(1204181, 150444, 24512, '<td valign="top">Great Photo.  Very sharp, nice colors and very nice translucent look on the wings agains the white background.  nice composition too.  vertical and horizontal wings, diagonal body with the head and beak looking down and to the right.  My question is now did you get this bird to pose so perfectly for you?  solid 10.  good job.</td>', 'Great Photo.  Very sharp, nice colors and very nice translucent look on the wings agains the white background.  nice composition too.  vertical and horizontal wings, diagonal body with the head and beak looking down and to the right.  My question is now did you get this bird to pose so perfectly for you?  solid 10.  good job.', '2005-03-02 19:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204186, 150856, 31606, '<td valign="top">Man I love this shot.  The only thing that bothers me is the yellow line in the border.  If it hadn''t of been for that I would have given you a ten.  Giving you a 9 instead.  I think this is good enough to place in the top three though.</td>', 'Man I love this shot.  The only thing that bothers me is the yellow line in the border.  If it hadn''t of been for that I would have given you a ten.  Giving you a 9 instead.  I think this is good enough to place in the top three though.', '2005-03-02 19:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
