(1204394, 150764, 33736, '<td valign="top">Sequential downloading is a spot reducer for my votes. I watch eagerly as an image slowly unfolds itself to me.  Near perfection - a 9 or a 10?  Then something annoying appears, which jars the soul - no more 9 or 10!  In this case, I would crop away the entire bottom quarter. Losing the lowest petal makes this image more powerful.</td>', 'Sequential downloading is a spot reducer for my votes. I watch eagerly as an image slowly unfolds itself to me.  Near perfection - a 9 or a 10?  Then something annoying appears, which jars the soul - no more 9 or 10!  In this case, I would crop away the entire bottom quarter. Losing the lowest petal makes this image more powerful.', '2005-03-02 21:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
