(1204441, 151737, 3649, '<td valign="top">love the contrast, but would like to see detail in the top edge of the body - I think it blew out, being closest to the light source. a little distance from the backdrop and softer, more directional light might help to define the subject better... -6-</td>', 'love the contrast, but would like to see detail in the top edge of the body - I think it blew out, being closest to the light source. a little distance from the backdrop and softer, more directional light might help to define the subject better... -6-', '2005-03-02 21:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
