(1204444, 150763, 30982, '<td valign="top">Striking picture - helps that your model is very pretty!  I''d prefer to see more of the other eye, and think it might be nice to have seen it in color.  One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Striking picture - helps that your model is very pretty!  I''d prefer to see more of the other eye, and think it might be nice to have seen it in color.  One of the best in the challenge.', '2005-03-02 21:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
