(1204451, 151628, 3649, '<td valign="top">beautiful, stunning lighting. the flowers certainly are predominantly a light color, while the stems fall into shadow, lending a very dark color... regardless, the composition and detail is beautiful and some of the lighter highlights just fall inside of clipping. Nice exposure. -9-</td>', 'beautiful, stunning lighting. the flowers certainly are predominantly a light color, while the stems fall into shadow, lending a very dark color... regardless, the composition and detail is beautiful and some of the lighter highlights just fall inside of clipping. Nice exposure. -9-', '2005-03-02 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
