(1204802, 151768, 33542, '<td valign="top">parts of the picture seem a bit over exposed, or maybe the contrast is too high... I can''t put my finger on it, but there''s something a little odd, especially about the section in the front right that makes it hard to get a handle on the perspective.</td>', 'parts of the picture seem a bit over exposed, or maybe the contrast is too high... I can''t put my finger on it, but there''s something a little odd, especially about the section in the front right that makes it hard to get a handle on the perspective.', '2005-03-03 00:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
