(1204806, 150023, 33542, '<td valign="top">Although I''m sure the bg was white, I would have liked to see it a little lighter in the picture. What are the crystals? They blend together. It would have been nice if they were a little crisper.</td>', 'Although I''m sure the bg was white, I would have liked to see it a little lighter in the picture. What are the crystals? They blend together. It would have been nice if they were a little crisper.', '2005-03-03 00:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
