(1204820, 149825, 33542, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but I don''t think it fits in this challenge. Most of the colors in the picture seem to be pretty dark except the face and that''s just white because of the contrast. Also, if the picture hadn''t been for this challenge you probably wouldn''t have made the contrast so high, which would have allowed the girl to keep her nose.</td>', 'I like this picture, but I don''t think it fits in this challenge. Most of the colors in the picture seem to be pretty dark except the face and that''s just white because of the contrast. Also, if the picture hadn''t been for this challenge you probably wouldn''t have made the contrast so high, which would have allowed the girl to keep her nose.', '2005-03-03 00:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204822, 150289, 33542, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus</td>', 'seems out of focus', '2005-03-03 00:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1204823, 151424, 33542, '<td valign="top">cute idea. I think the picture would have been even better had you curved the bg more so you couldn''t see the horizontal line in the back.</td>', 'cute idea. I think the picture would have been even better had you curved the bg more so you couldn''t see the horizontal line in the back.', '2005-03-03 00:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
