(1204828, 151707, 33542, '<td valign="top">I think a smaller aperture would have helped control the glare on the CD. Also, I''d have left a little more of the picture to the left of the CD and there seems to be some noise in the picture that''s distracting.</td>', 'I think a smaller aperture would have helped control the glare on the CD. Also, I''d have left a little more of the picture to the left of the CD and there seems to be some noise in the picture that''s distracting.', '2005-03-03 00:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
