(1204838, 151809, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m not thrilled about the positioning of the light here... maybe top right would have been better, causing a looped shadow from the handle, too.</td>', 'I''m not thrilled about the positioning of the light here... maybe top right would have been better, causing a looped shadow from the handle, too.', '2005-03-03 00:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
