(1205121, 151566, 3724, '<td valign="top">Seems like a stark arrangement.  Looks good on my monitor -  plain and minimal but with excellent tonality and clean whites.  Vignette seems a dash too evident,  Meets the challenge, snow is white,  and says so in the title - but I belive it without the title.   Curious as one of my favorites in this challenge, for abstract qualities - especially for how I see the question of a background handled, a required specification.  Viewed as a snow drift detail, which is what I assume it is, it has little or none.  In this the subject is background.  Viewed as an abstract field, still the brightest whites seem to protrude, do not flatten or recede.  Litterally as light or lumens or wattage on white, it functions.   Still the subject  texture, as subliminal as it is -  moves.  The  idea has potential.   The workmanship  and design is good.</td>', 'Seems like a stark arrangement.  Looks good on my monitor -  plain and minimal but with excellent tonality and clean whites.  Vignette seems a dash too evident,  Meets the challenge, snow is white,  and says so in the title - but I belive it without the title.   Curious as one of my favorites in this challenge, for abstract qualities - especially for how I see the question of a background handled, a required specification.  Viewed as a snow drift detail, which is what I assume it is, it has little or none.  In this the subject is background.  Viewed as an abstract field, still the brightest whites seem to protrude, do not flatten or recede.  Litterally as light or lumens or wattage on white, it functions.   Still the subject  texture, as subliminal as it is -  moves.  The  idea has potential.   The workmanship  and design is good.', '2005-03-03 07:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
