(1205200, 151868, 19841, '<td valign="top">Hey!  Something besides eggs!  Good idea.  I can almost smell it.</td>', 'Hey!  Something besides eggs!  Good idea.  I can almost smell it.', '2005-03-03 09:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205201, 150052, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous picture, I love roses.  I also like the contrast of the white on the white background.  I also like the stem of the flower it brings out the picture more.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous picture, I love roses.  I also like the contrast of the white on the white background.  I also like the stem of the flower it brings out the picture more.', '2005-03-03 09:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205202, 150052, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. I love how you can see the detail on each petal as well as each leave. The light color of the flower looks great against the white background.This flower definately is a thing of beauty. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. I love how you can see the detail on each petal as well as each leave. The light color of the flower looks great against the white background.This flower definately is a thing of beauty. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205203, 149803, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty picture.  I love the white pedals with the pink middle, it is very pretty.  I also like how you showed so much water coming off of the flower, it makes it look very real.</td>', 'This is a very pretty picture.  I love the white pedals with the pink middle, it is very pretty.  I also like how you showed so much water coming off of the flower, it makes it look very real.', '2005-03-03 09:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205204, 150904, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I love the way you were able to catch the droplets of water. There is a lot of detail in this shot and I think that is great. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I love the way you were able to catch the droplets of water. There is a lot of detail in this shot and I think that is great. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205205, 151783, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, I like the pearl idea, because they are a off white color.  It looks very nice on the white backgorund.</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, I like the pearl idea, because they are a off white color.  It looks very nice on the white backgorund.', '2005-03-03 09:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205206, 150914, 32695, '<td valign="top">Awww this is very cute!  I like the bird against the snow and then you see its pink feathers,  i like this picture alot.  It was a very creative idea.!</td>', 'Awww this is very cute!  I like the bird against the snow and then you see its pink feathers,  i like this picture alot.  It was a very creative idea.!', '2005-03-03 09:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205208, 151312, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. I love how you can see each dot on the golf ball. I also love the shadow seen in this image. There are great uses of value in this photograph. I like how you also captured great detail. NIce work.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. I love how you can see each dot on the golf ball. I also love the shadow seen in this image. There are great uses of value in this photograph. I like how you also captured great detail. NIce work.', '2005-03-03 09:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205210, 150388, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I love how everything almost looks as if it is the same color but just in different shades. I also like how you can see the detail in the game pieces. I also really like the reflection seen in this image. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I love how everything almost looks as if it is the same color but just in different shades. I also like how you can see the detail in the game pieces. I also really like the reflection seen in this image. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205212, 150976, 32695, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, it is so pretty and peacful.  I love the way you intertwined the idea of light on white with the swans in the water.  What a great idea..i also like the ripples of the water coming off of the swans.</td>', 'I love this shot, it is so pretty and peacful.  I love the way you intertwined the idea of light on white with the swans in the water.  What a great idea..i also like the ripples of the water coming off of the swans.', '2005-03-03 09:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205214, 151479, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting picture.  I love the look of texture in the picture from the chess board.  I also like the chess peices that almost blend with the background.  This was also a very neat angle to take the pictures at.</td>', 'This is a very interesting picture.  I love the look of texture in the picture from the chess board.  I also like the chess peices that almost blend with the background.  This was also a very neat angle to take the pictures at.', '2005-03-03 09:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205215, 151720, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I like the way the light bulb almost completely blends in with its background but at the same time you can see the outline of it. I think you captured the detail nicely. Good work.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I like the way the light bulb almost completely blends in with its background but at the same time you can see the outline of it. I think you captured the detail nicely. Good work.', '2005-03-03 09:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205216, 150982, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I like how you can see each individual piece coming out from the center. There is also a lot of detail in the entire subject. I love how many different lines can be seen to. Another nice thing about this shot is you can see texture and weight in this picture. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I like how you can see each individual piece coming out from the center. There is also a lot of detail in the entire subject. I love how many different lines can be seen to. Another nice thing about this shot is you can see texture and weight in this picture. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205217, 151870, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a cutew picture, and also a cute bird!  I like the title, it really expresses the idea of the photo.  This is also a good picture beause the texture and features of the bird set off the white background.</td>', 'This is a cutew picture, and also a cute bird!  I like the title, it really expresses the idea of the photo.  This is also a good picture beause the texture and features of the bird set off the white background.', '2005-03-03 09:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205218, 151715, 27524, '<td valign="top">Like that people invent something interesting together with ordinary things.</td>', 'Like that people invent something interesting together with ordinary things.', '2005-03-03 09:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205219, 151255, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a neat picture, i like the way the milk is pouring into the glass.  It looks neat against the white background.  Also the texture of the cup gives a neat affect to the picture.</td>', 'This is a neat picture, i like the way the milk is pouring into the glass.  It looks neat against the white background.  Also the texture of the cup gives a neat affect to the picture.', '2005-03-03 09:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205221, 150704, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, a little fuzzy, but over all a nice shot. If this image were a little sharper the detail would be perfect. I like your concept though. I love how you were able to catch the coloring so well to. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, a little fuzzy, but over all a nice shot. If this image were a little sharper the detail would be perfect. I like your concept though. I love how you were able to catch the coloring so well to. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205222, 150132, 27524, '<td valign="top">The think I like the moust in picture is curved surface... making picture more live.</td>', 'The think I like the moust in picture is curved surface... making picture more live.', '2005-03-03 09:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205223, 151347, 32695, '<td valign="top">I like this picture and the title of the picture!  It is neat how the glass is tipping, and the liquid moves with it.  It also sets off the white background with the lining of the glass.</td>', 'I like this picture and the title of the picture!  It is neat how the glass is tipping, and the liquid moves with it.  It also sets off the white background with the lining of the glass.', '2005-03-03 09:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205225, 150556, 27524, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and colors... rich compozition.</td>', 'Good lighting and colors... rich compozition.', '2005-03-03 09:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205226, 150731, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I love how you were able to pretty much catch a white background. You can tell the bird is actually in the sky because you can see hints of other colors but overall the background looks white. I also like how you caught the bird in the air. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I love how you were able to pretty much catch a white background. You can tell the bird is actually in the sky because you can see hints of other colors but overall the background looks white. I also like how you caught the bird in the air. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205227, 151372, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its extraordinary... picture that differs always attracts attention. The mist and stone is specially nice.</td>', 'Its extraordinary... picture that differs always attracts attention. The mist and stone is specially nice.', '2005-03-03 09:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205229, 151067, 27524, '<td valign="top">Simple and nice... like those tonalities of colors...</td>', 'Simple and nice... like those tonalities of colors...', '2005-03-03 09:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205230, 150976, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot. You caught the swans looking so elegant and beautiful which also reminds you of light colors. I love how you caught the detail in the water near the swans as well. You caught so much white in your background too which really adds to your image. This is my favorite picture I ''ve seen in this challenge so far. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a very nice shot. You caught the swans looking so elegant and beautiful which also reminds you of light colors. I love how you caught the detail in the water near the swans as well. You caught so much white in your background too which really adds to your image. This is my favorite picture I ''ve seen in this challenge so far. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205231, 151702, 32695, '<td valign="top">Oooooah... nice picture. I love nature pictures and this is perfect everything is covered in snow and it gives the perfect effect you need for this shot.  Then i love the way the tree that comes to your attention first is shown alittle but at the same tiem covered in snow.I give this a 10!!</td>', 'Oooooah... nice picture. I love nature pictures and this is perfect everything is covered in snow and it gives the perfect effect you need for this shot.  Then i love the way the tree that comes to your attention first is shown alittle but at the same tiem covered in snow.I give this a 10!!', '2005-03-03 09:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205233, 151675, 27524, '<td valign="top">The light and shallow DOF makes picture like dreamy.</td>', 'The light and shallow DOF makes picture like dreamy.', '2005-03-03 09:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205235, 151482, 32633, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. Each item in this image is approximately the same color; however, with the way the items are placed, it almost seems as if the shadow defines the images and gives the shape. Nice work.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. Each item in this image is approximately the same color; however, with the way the items are placed, it almost seems as if the shadow defines the images and gives the shape. Nice work.', '2005-03-03 09:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205236, 151457, 32695, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it is very pretty and it is kind of emotional at the same time.  Its like the end of your wedding day and its just so pretty!</td>', 'I like this photo, it is very pretty and it is kind of emotional at the same time.  Its like the end of your wedding day and its just so pretty!', '2005-03-03 09:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205237, 150493, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very simple but attractive capture... shape make it all.</td>', 'Very simple but attractive capture... shape make it all.', '2005-03-03 09:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205241, 151357, 27524, '<td valign="top">Its very nice... but it have lots of blue and green tonalities.</td>', 'Its very nice... but it have lots of blue and green tonalities.', '2005-03-03 09:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205242, 151757, 27845, '<td valign="top">Nice title ;) Excellenzt lighting, There are only mior blown-out areas. The shadow is very soft. I don''t see what the negative space adds here though. 7.</td>', 'Nice title ;) Excellenzt lighting, There are only mior blown-out areas. The shadow is very soft. I don''t see what the negative space adds here though. 7.', '2005-03-03 09:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1205244, 150613, 27845, '<td valign="top">Wow. Nice detail. I like the soft yellow tone. Excellent lighting. I''d have cropped about 10px off the bottom, to get rif of that little white space between the parts of the petal that touch the border. 9.</td>', 'Wow. Nice detail. I like the soft yellow tone. Excellent lighting. I''d have cropped about 10px off the bottom, to get rif of that little white space between the parts of the petal that touch the border. 9.', '2005-03-03 09:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
