(1206639, 151841, 30841, '<td valign="top">It was a great idea and fits the theme well, but the light sourece is way too reflective. If the white was solid all across this would have done well. Having an object which lies so flat on the foreground makes it extremely difficult to adjust to separate the two. Keep up the good ideas!</td>', 'It was a great idea and fits the theme well, but the light sourece is way too reflective. If the white was solid all across this would have done well. Having an object which lies so flat on the foreground makes it extremely difficult to adjust to separate the two. Keep up the good ideas!', '2005-03-03 21:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
