(1207071, 151684, 25232, '<td valign="top">Great composition and it''s not a damn egg. 9</td>', 'Great composition and it''s not a damn egg. 9', '2005-03-04 02:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207072, 151306, 25232, '<td valign="top">Haven''t you heard of the ongoing fight against cholesterol? Just say no to eggs.</td>', 'Haven''t you heard of the ongoing fight against cholesterol? Just say no to eggs.', '2005-03-04 02:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207073, 150162, 25232, '<td valign="top">cat looks a little overexposed. Good photo anyway.</td>', 'cat looks a little overexposed. Good photo anyway.', '2005-03-04 02:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207077, 151806, 28801, '<td valign="top">Looks impressive, though I can''t really figure out what it is.</td>', 'Looks impressive, though I can''t really figure out what it is.', '2005-03-04 03:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207081, 151877, 24983, '<td valign="top">I like this shot it is imaginitive and well thought out,The problem is the back ground is way overlit.It should be only 1 stop over. the lighting on the figure should be soft and shadowless. John Hedgecoe on pages138/39 of his book The Photographers handbook shows how, this is an excellent book on photography.I would like to see this done again and with a bit of soft focus thrown in. However since i''m a ood guy I dont vote down for the idea 8</td>', 'I like this shot it is imaginitive and well thought out,The problem is the back ground is way overlit.It should be only 1 stop over. the lighting on the figure should be soft and shadowless. John Hedgecoe on pages138/39 of his book The Photographers handbook shows how, this is an excellent book on photography.I would like to see this done again and with a bit of soft focus thrown in. However since i''m a ood guy I dont vote down for the idea 8', '2005-03-04 03:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207083, 151254, 24983, '<td valign="top">You might have  had a few that say it doesn''t meet the challenge, I agree but it is a neat image any way 8</td>', 'You might have  had a few that say it doesn''t meet the challenge, I agree but it is a neat image any way 8', '2005-03-04 03:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207085, 150865, 24983, '<td valign="top">good idea I would have cropped most of the back ground out making it a panoramis shot that would have made it a stronger image IMO 5</td>', 'good idea I would have cropped most of the back ground out making it a panoramis shot that would have made it a stronger image IMO 5', '2005-03-04 03:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207086, 150535, 24983, '<td valign="top">cute although the background is overlit and it s blown out on the bottom. best type of light for this is too bounce it off the ceiling and meter you background so it is only 1 stop over the exposure, 5</td>', 'cute although the background is overlit and it s blown out on the bottom. best type of light for this is too bounce it off the ceiling and meter you background so it is only 1 stop over the exposure, 5', '2005-03-04 03:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207088, 151862, 24983, '<td valign="top">Thiws has the makings but has missed out,why? (a) direct flashis a no no bounce it off the ceiling for soft shadowless lighting (b) move your moel further from the background so shadows are not cast.(c) light background independant of the main light giving it 1 stop more light.   3</td>', 'Thiws has the makings but has missed out,why? (a) direct flashis a no no bounce it off the ceiling for soft shadowless lighting (b) move your moel further from the background so shadows are not cast.(c) light background independant of the main light giving it 1 stop more light.   3', '2005-03-04 03:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207090, 151842, 31049, '<td valign="top">Wow, the title could really be misinterpreted in this one (I bet I''m not the only one saying so). Good composition, though the eye is being led outside the frame by the gentle spiral. You should have tried cropping it a little looser.</td>', 'Wow, the title could really be misinterpreted in this one (I bet I''m not the only one saying so). Good composition, though the eye is being led outside the frame by the gentle spiral. You should have tried cropping it a little looser.', '2005-03-04 03:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207091, 150701, 24983, '<td valign="top">good shot but could be improved by (a) placing pieces of black card either side of glass(outside camera range, this gives an edge to the glass. (b) the background needs to be lighter maybe by reflecting light back into it with a white card, you do need some distance between subject and background.  3</td>', 'good shot but could be improved by (a) placing pieces of black card either side of glass(outside camera range, this gives an edge to the glass. (b) the background needs to be lighter maybe by reflecting light back into it with a white card, you do need some distance between subject and background.  3', '2005-03-04 03:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207094, 151167, 24983, '<td valign="top">good idea but you have lost seperation between the top of the can and the background I would have dropped the brightness of the back ground a lot more,.</td>', 'good idea but you have lost seperation between the top of the can and the background I would have dropped the brightness of the back ground a lot more,.', '2005-03-04 03:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207095, 151837, 24983, '<td valign="top">Ok it has faults but I like it thats just me a good bit of fun worth 8</td>', 'Ok it has faults but I like it thats just me a good bit of fun worth 8', '2005-03-04 03:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207096, 151671, 24983, '<td valign="top">the tones are too close together with no true white</td>', 'the tones are too close together with no true white', '2005-03-04 03:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207097, 151842, 24983, '<td valign="top">good Idea but your high lights have blown on the top left of the lilly which is a shame, try lighting with the flash bouned from the ceiling,.</td>', 'good Idea but your high lights have blown on the top left of the lilly which is a shame, try lighting with the flash bouned from the ceiling,.', '2005-03-04 03:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207099, 151865, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very slick.  Nice composition and lighting.</td>', 'Very slick.  Nice composition and lighting.', '2005-03-04 03:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207100, 151742, 24642, '<td valign="top">Compositon and lighting could be improved.</td>', 'Compositon and lighting could be improved.', '2005-03-04 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
