(1207102, 150459, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.  I really like the simplicity.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.  I really like the simplicity.', '2005-03-04 03:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207103, 150159, 24642, '<td valign="top">Too complex and does not have a strong connection to the challenge IMO.</td>', 'Too complex and does not have a strong connection to the challenge IMO.', '2005-03-04 03:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207104, 151568, 25309, '<td valign="top">focus problem?</td>', 'focus problem?', '2005-03-04 03:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207105, 150712, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, good flow and tonal range.  A bit grainy in the sky.<br/>Delivers space, freedom and a lot of fresh air.</td>', 'Nice composition, good flow and tonal range.  A bit grainy in the sky.Delivers space, freedom and a lot of fresh air.', '2005-03-04 03:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207107, 151646, 24983, '<td valign="top">Great Idea but it is way over lit ive my laptop puhed right back to get s dekko at this image., how did you light this,? the best type of light fot this style is soft and full. bouncing the light off  white ceiling and using a light diffusion filter would hsve worked wonders.</td>', 'Great Idea but it is way over lit ive my laptop puhed right back to get s dekko at this image., how did you light this,? the best type of light fot this style is soft and full. bouncing the light off  white ceiling and using a light diffusion filter would hsve worked wonders.', '2005-03-04 03:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207108, 151306, 24983, '<td valign="top">good try but the background on my monitor sees it as grey, which is a pity as I would have scored this higher had it been white,.</td>', 'good try but the background on my monitor sees it as grey, which is a pity as I would have scored this higher had it been white,.', '2005-03-04 04:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207110, 150459, 3649, '<td valign="top">the best egg shot of the bunch, by far. the subtle tones and shading combined with the composition and repeated roundness really make for an interesting image. the only thing that bothers me are the multiple shadows cast by the egg and apparent multiple light sources. nicely executed. -8-</td>', 'the best egg shot of the bunch, by far. the subtle tones and shading combined with the composition and repeated roundness really make for an interesting image. the only thing that bothers me are the multiple shadows cast by the egg and apparent multiple light sources. nicely executed. -8-', '2005-03-04 04:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207113, 151297, 3649, '<td valign="top">a pretty image, to be sure. I would have prefered the top not be cropped and that the bluish light be restricted to the flower itself (I know, not quite possible in this situation), leaving the background more pure white. -7-</td>', 'a pretty image, to be sure. I would have prefered the top not be cropped and that the bluish light be restricted to the flower itself (I know, not quite possible in this situation), leaving the background more pure white. -7-', '2005-03-04 04:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207117, 151646, 3649, '<td valign="top">I like the concept behind this shot, but feel like there are a few more steps that would have really helped it out. The composition works pretty well and the midtones are nicely exposed. The couch (especially on the left) is somewhat distracting (as is the smudge on the wall), as is the interplay of the model''s legs with each other and the umbrella point. The blown-out sole of the right foot leaves it lacking definition. Finally, the strap on the umbrella could have been left out of the image if only it were rotated 90 degrees. Overall not a bad shot, but many small details add up. Keep at it.</td>', 'I like the concept behind this shot, but feel like there are a few more steps that would have really helped it out. The composition works pretty well and the midtones are nicely exposed. The couch (especially on the left) is somewhat distracting (as is the smudge on the wall), as is the interplay of the model''s legs with each other and the umbrella point. The blown-out sole of the right foot leaves it lacking definition. Finally, the strap on the umbrella could have been left out of the image if only it were rotated 90 degrees. Overall not a bad shot, but many small details add up. Keep at it.', '2005-03-04 04:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207118, 150241, 3649, '<td valign="top">would have preferred the glass be further from the background, so as not to cast a shadow. the droplets seem to come from nowhere and might better have been rendered as a stream, to give more motion and smoothness to the shot, with possibly more (1/3?) liquid in the glass.</td>', 'would have preferred the glass be further from the background, so as not to cast a shadow. the droplets seem to come from nowhere and might better have been rendered as a stream, to give more motion and smoothness to the shot, with possibly more (1/3?) liquid in the glass.', '2005-03-04 04:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207120, 151373, 3649, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but would prefer to see the model in a different pose. As it is, it feels... un-ladylike? Not very feminine? The lighting isn''t bad, but for this challenge would prefer a little softer, diffused light to help alleviate the depth and darkness of the shadows.</td>', 'I like the idea, but would prefer to see the model in a different pose. As it is, it feels... un-ladylike? Not very feminine? The lighting isn''t bad, but for this challenge would prefer a little softer, diffused light to help alleviate the depth and darkness of the shadows.', '2005-03-04 04:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207123, 151827, 3649, '<td valign="top">I think the backlighting kills it for me (as does the sky for this challenge). Perhaps cropping out the trees would help the composition, as well, letting your eye quickly settle and focus on the snowboarder. Fun shot.</td>', 'I think the backlighting kills it for me (as does the sky for this challenge). Perhaps cropping out the trees would help the composition, as well, letting your eye quickly settle and focus on the snowboarder. Fun shot.', '2005-03-04 04:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207125, 149995, 3649, '<td valign="top">Alright, I''m hooked - I''m curious how you got the bulb to glow... running bare wires to the contacts? I think a boost of ambient light to the scene (or a levels/curves adjustment) could really help this shot to pop. As it is, the grayish background and relatively low contrast dulls it out a bit too much for my tastes.</td>', 'Alright, I''m hooked - I''m curious how you got the bulb to glow... running bare wires to the contacts? I think a boost of ambient light to the scene (or a levels/curves adjustment) could really help this shot to pop. As it is, the grayish background and relatively low contrast dulls it out a bit too much for my tastes.', '2005-03-04 04:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207128, 150212, 3649, '<td valign="top">that''s for #1 and #2, right? don''t worry, you didn''t get either from me :) Would have liked to have seen a bit more either transition or brightness to the background and perhaps a tighter crop on the roll to put it more on the 1/3 lines vertically. Maybe a "stream" of paper leading your eye into the shot towards the roll and a more "pristine" roll (round and smooth) would also help...</td>', 'that''s for #1 and #2, right? don''t worry, you didn''t get either from me :) Would have liked to have seen a bit more either transition or brightness to the background and perhaps a tighter crop on the roll to put it more on the 1/3 lines vertically. Maybe a "stream" of paper leading your eye into the shot towards the roll and a more "pristine" roll (round and smooth) would also help...', '2005-03-04 04:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207129, 151717, 25309, '<td valign="top">We can''t distinguish properly the swimmer, it''s a very nice photo . May be cropping a little bit more the empty space above...?</td>', 'We can''t distinguish properly the swimmer, it''s a very nice photo . May be cropping a little bit more the empty space above...?', '2005-03-04 04:29:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1207131, 151728, 3649, '<td valign="top">i love the reflections on the bottle and in the glass, but would have preferred some color in the shot. White wine is usually a very light color to begin with and I think it would have added the extra pop to this well-composed and well-lit image. -7-</td>', 'i love the reflections on the bottle and in the glass, but would have preferred some color in the shot. White wine is usually a very light color to begin with and I think it would have added the extra pop to this well-composed and well-lit image. -7-', '2005-03-04 04:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207135, 150346, 3649, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, mood and lighting in this shot. It think it would score well in Surrealism and only wish it were a tad sharper and the color/tones were reversed (tan-ish mannequins and white wall). Very nicely captured. -8-</td>', 'I love the composition, mood and lighting in this shot. It think it would score well in Surrealism and only wish it were a tad sharper and the color/tones were reversed (tan-ish mannequins and white wall). Very nicely captured. -8-', '2005-03-04 04:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207136, 150357, 3649, '<td valign="top">everything works - color, composition and lighting. Since the white here feels relatively white compared to the subjects (while somewhat off-white), it works. Great control of DOF and the sickeningly sweet "cute" factor. :) -9-</td>', 'everything works - color, composition and lighting. Since the white here feels relatively white compared to the subjects (while somewhat off-white), it works. Great control of DOF and the sickeningly sweet "cute" factor. :) -9-', '2005-03-04 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207137, 150308, 3649, '<td valign="top">Well-captured for artificial flowers. At first glance, they look quite real -- good control of lighting to keep from highlighting the give-away artificial features. -8-</td>', 'Well-captured for artificial flowers. At first glance, they look quite real -- good control of lighting to keep from highlighting the give-away artificial features. -8-', '2005-03-04 04:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207138, 151435, 3649, '<td valign="top">Of all the veggie shots, this one wins. The subtle color tones and soft lighting really highlight the features of the onions well and the composition and crop choice is perfect to balance out the negative space on the left. My only major nit is the overly bright (blown?) spot on the main onion... otherwise, very nicely captured. -8-</td>', 'Of all the veggie shots, this one wins. The subtle color tones and soft lighting really highlight the features of the onions well and the composition and crop choice is perfect to balance out the negative space on the left. My only major nit is the overly bright (blown?) spot on the main onion... otherwise, very nicely captured. -8-', '2005-03-04 04:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207139, 151624, 3649, '<td valign="top">there''s a certain humor to this shot, thought I don''t know that I can put my finger on it. Nice. -7-</td>', 'there''s a certain humor to this shot, thought I don''t know that I can put my finger on it. Nice. -7-', '2005-03-04 04:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207141, 150159, 3649, '<td valign="top">You certainly were mindful of over-exposing your highlights. Well done. -10- :)</td>', 'You certainly were mindful of over-exposing your highlights. Well done. -10- :)', '2005-03-04 04:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207159, 151486, 34547, '<td valign="top">I love it.  My eye keeps going toward the darker feather up top-left.</td>', 'I love it.  My eye keeps going toward the darker feather up top-left.', '2005-03-04 05:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207160, 151373, 34547, '<td valign="top">Not sure I want to go Light on White, but enjoyable nonetheless!</td>', 'Not sure I want to go Light on White, but enjoyable nonetheless!', '2005-03-04 05:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207162, 151394, 34547, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Her eyes draw you in...um, like you said.  That earing looks heavy! I love the photo.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Her eyes draw you in...um, like you said.  That earing looks heavy! I love the photo.', '2005-03-04 05:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207164, 151862, 34547, '<td valign="top">Odd...but "titillating." Her paited face is distracting.</td>', 'Odd...but "titillating." Her paited face is distracting.', '2005-03-04 05:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207165, 150044, 34547, '<td valign="top">I think this would be better if it were less pink, and since this is stop-motion, I keep wanting to see a sharper splash--something more plastic-like. Not bad.</td>', 'I think this would be better if it were less pink, and since this is stop-motion, I keep wanting to see a sharper splash--something more plastic-like. Not bad.', '2005-03-04 05:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
