(1207211, 151341, 32595, '<td valign="top">I like, this does express a feeling, people are so much more interesting than things. I am (assuming) this is a B&amp;W and I also think it definetly is in line with challange it is apparent things a white or light weather there B&amp;W or not...Nice job.</td>', 'I like, this does express a feeling, people are so much more interesting than things. I am (assuming) this is a B&W and I also think it definetly is in line with challange it is apparent things a white or light weather there B&W or not...Nice job.', '2005-03-04 07:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
