(1207424, 151673, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 8 A very nice attempt and good use of the light colors. Original idea of using cotton.<br/>Technical: 6 I think maybe a light projected at it would have enhanced the cotton fibers and the texture in the white background would have disappeared from the light.<br/>Composition": 10 I call it centered right which gives a good effect on something with curves. Good choice of angle. <br/>Appeal: 7 I liked the ripples in the background I liked the bowl enhancing curves I just needed less texture in the material used for the background.<br/>Overall: 8</td>', 'Challenge: 8 A very nice attempt and good use of the light colors. Original idea of using cotton.Technical: 6 I think maybe a light projected at it would have enhanced the cotton fibers and the texture in the white background would have disappeared from the light.Composition": 10 I call it centered right which gives a good effect on something with curves. Good choice of angle. Appeal: 7 I liked the ripples in the background I liked the bowl enhancing curves I just needed less texture in the material used for the background.Overall: 8', '2005-03-04 11:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
