(1207638, 151475, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 I like the light pink and works well with the white background<br/>Technical: 10 good focus excellent use of color <br/>Composition: 10 I like the positioning of the image<br/>Appeal: 1 I wish you would dont away with the extra petals I think thats what they are. one of them is actually bluring out the 2nd flower from the top. It may have been an effect you were trying but its distracting.<br/>Overall: 8 good shot overall</td>', 'Challenge: 10 I like the light pink and works well with the white backgroundTechnical: 10 good focus excellent use of color Composition: 10 I like the positioning of the imageAppeal: 1 I wish you would dont away with the extra petals I think thats what they are. one of them is actually bluring out the 2nd flower from the top. It may have been an effect you were trying but its distracting.Overall: 8 good shot overall', '2005-03-04 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207643, 150381, 26633, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, viewpoint and composition. Looking up at the rim of the glass is a nice touch. A hint more light on the lemon rind and this would have been a 10.</td>', 'Love the lighting, viewpoint and composition. Looking up at the rim of the glass is a nice touch. A hint more light on the lemon rind and this would have been a 10.', '2005-03-04 14:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207645, 151613, 26633, '<td valign="top">Simple and very nicely lit. Just enough texture in the apple without it starting to dominate.</td>', 'Simple and very nicely lit. Just enough texture in the apple without it starting to dominate.', '2005-03-04 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207649, 151859, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 7 I just not seeing the white background its looking more of a gray. Maybe adding some light from a couple of directions could have solved this.<br/>Technical: 10 I like the focus and DOF I can see good texture so I see the sharpness is good.<br/>Compostion: 10 I ike how you placed the subject just a tad of centered makes the image work will with this kind of subject.<br/>Appeal: 3 I think I would have liked it more if you would have had a white background using lighting then you would have seen shadows of the various textures.<br/>Overall: 7</td>', 'Challenge: 7 I just not seeing the white background its looking more of a gray. Maybe adding some light from a couple of directions could have solved this.Technical: 10 I like the focus and DOF I can see good texture so I see the sharpness is good.Compostion: 10 I ike how you placed the subject just a tad of centered makes the image work will with this kind of subject.Appeal: 3 I think I would have liked it more if you would have had a white background using lighting then you would have seen shadows of the various textures.Overall: 7', '2005-03-04 14:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207650, 150794, 26633, '<td valign="top">Great work, very simple but then all the best ideas are! Nice bit of texture in the cork, lovely whites, immaculate lighting.</td>', 'Great work, very simple but then all the best ideas are! Nice bit of texture in the cork, lovely whites, immaculate lighting.', '2005-03-04 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207654, 151489, 30625, '<td valign="top">Challenge: 10 Nice white background good light color with a blue as the major tone.<br/>Technical: 10 excellent DOF The droplets are reflecting light back with touch of glare.<br/>Composition: 10 I love the angle changes the aspect of the shot <br/>Appeal: 10 I would frame it.<br/>Overall: 10 cant go wrong with the droplet shot.</td>', 'Challenge: 10 Nice white background good light color with a blue as the major tone.Technical: 10 excellent DOF The droplets are reflecting light back with touch of glare.Composition: 10 I love the angle changes the aspect of the shot Appeal: 10 I would frame it.Overall: 10 cant go wrong with the droplet shot.', '2005-03-04 14:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207659, 151438, 33947, '<td valign="top">Like the light on the flower. Very nice. Also liked how you cropped it.</td>', 'Like the light on the flower. Very nice. Also liked how you cropped it.', '2005-03-04 14:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207667, 151852, 32672, '<td valign="top">Cute, creative, absurd twist.  I like it.<br/>It was Averell--he beat and batterd th egg!</td>', 'Cute, creative, absurd twist.  I like it.It was Averell--he beat and batterd th egg!', '2005-03-04 14:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207669, 151365, 32672, '<td valign="top">Astounding.</td>', 'Astounding.', '2005-03-04 14:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207673, 151188, 19010, '<td valign="top">This was my #1 pick for the challenge... Great job. I love the true white that you managed to acheive on both the foreground and the background. The gentile curves and crisp focus are absolutaly delightfull to look at. Thanks for sharring this great shot with us and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This was my #1 pick for the challenge... Great job. I love the true white that you managed to acheive on both the foreground and the background. The gentile curves and crisp focus are absolutaly delightfull to look at. Thanks for sharring this great shot with us and good luck in the challenge.', '2005-03-04 14:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207676, 151877, 19010, '<td valign="top">Very attractive photo. The curves are pleasant to look at and I feel it fits the challenge well. The white cloth and the white backgroung are both pure white. They blend nicely  together yet there is a definate separation of the two whites. Great job. I hope to see more wonderfull shots like this in the future. 9</td>', 'Very attractive photo. The curves are pleasant to look at and I feel it fits the challenge well. The white cloth and the white backgroung are both pure white. They blend nicely  together yet there is a definate separation of the two whites. Great job. I hope to see more wonderfull shots like this in the future. 9', '2005-03-04 14:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207682, 149865, 19010, '<td valign="top">Usualy I vote shots of common boring objects like this one down. But you managed realy make this one stand out. The black comming from the crayon was fun. However what realy managed to catch my attention was the bizzare angle of the crayon and the fact that it had no visable support. This fits the challenge perfectly. The pure white croy and the pure white back ground. yet a definate separation of the two great shot..9</td>', 'Usualy I vote shots of common boring objects like this one down. But you managed realy make this one stand out. The black comming from the crayon was fun. However what realy managed to catch my attention was the bizzare angle of the crayon and the fact that it had no visable support. This fits the challenge perfectly. The pure white croy and the pure white back ground. yet a definate separation of the two great shot..9', '2005-03-04 14:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1207685, 151151, 19010, '<td valign="top">great capture and fits the challenge well. An emotional and seemingly tough moment to photograph.. I love the crisp details on the feather my only wish would be to have the bird a bit more in focus as well. Wonderfull shot 8</td>', 'great capture and fits the challenge well. An emotional and seemingly tough moment to photograph.. I love the crisp details on the feather my only wish would be to have the bird a bit more in focus as well. Wonderfull shot 8', '2005-03-04 14:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
