(1207714, 150075, 32513, '<td valign="top">AHHHH!!!! Get rid of the date stamp in the lower right hand corner. That just sreams amature around here. If you can''t turn it off, then try and shoot in a way that will allow you to safely crop it out of the picture later, or, if you''re more hands on and have the ability, you could paint it out of the picture as well. Either way you go, it will help you out a whole bunch.</td>', 'AHHHH!!!! Get rid of the date stamp in the lower right hand corner. That just sreams amature around here. If you can''t turn it off, then try and shoot in a way that will allow you to safely crop it out of the picture later, or, if you''re more hands on and have the ability, you could paint it out of the picture as well. Either way you go, it will help you out a whole bunch.', '2005-03-04 15:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
