(1207962, 151716, 33515, '<td valign="top">I really like your photo and can appreciate how hard it can be to keep a dog poised. The problem is the top of the dogs head and neck is to over exposed.</td>', 'I really like your photo and can appreciate how hard it can be to keep a dog poised. The problem is the top of the dogs head and neck is to over exposed.', '2005-03-04 17:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
