(1208276, 149884, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF.  I like the flow in the seams.  It seems like there is a problem with white balance.  The background seems a bit to blue to me.  -6</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF.  I like the flow in the seams.  It seems like there is a problem with white balance.  The background seems a bit to blue to me.  -6', '2005-03-04 20:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208280, 150836, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good subject with good lighting.  I feel that the frame is out of balance with the suble subject.</td>', 'Good subject with good lighting.  I feel that the frame is out of balance with the suble subject.', '2005-03-04 20:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208283, 151457, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good work with suble colours.  I really like the overexposure in the background and the DOF.  Very professional work.</td>', 'Good work with suble colours.  I really like the overexposure in the background and the DOF.  Very professional work.', '2005-03-04 20:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208287, 149995, 24642, '<td valign="top">Clever idea but somehow a rather dull composition.</td>', 'Clever idea but somehow a rather dull composition.', '2005-03-04 20:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208288, 151823, 31620, '<td valign="top">Great detail.</td>', 'Great detail.', '2005-03-04 20:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208291, 150172, 24642, '<td valign="top">Nice title, composition and lighting work well.  Something feels fake about the arm.</td>', 'Nice title, composition and lighting work well.  Something feels fake about the arm.', '2005-03-04 20:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208293, 151830, 24642, '<td valign="top">Less sharpening and a tigher crop from the bottom would IMO help hte image. -4</td>', 'Less sharpening and a tigher crop from the bottom would IMO help hte image. -4', '2005-03-04 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208298, 151324, 24642, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful shot.  I really love the blur and the strong light coming from the right.  I really wonder about the strong pink cast on the image, if it was intentional or not.  A very good study with ice, light and movement.  -8</td>', 'This is such a beautiful shot.  I really love the blur and the strong light coming from the right.  I really wonder about the strong pink cast on the image, if it was intentional or not.  A very good study with ice, light and movement.  -8', '2005-03-04 20:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208299, 150525, 18194, '<td valign="top">This photo is way under exposed and pretty soft.</td>', 'This photo is way under exposed and pretty soft.', '2005-03-04 20:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208302, 151717, 18194, '<td valign="top">Well the background looks more green then white to me and I am not sure what the light colored subject is.</td>', 'Well the background looks more green then white to me and I am not sure what the light colored subject is.', '2005-03-04 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208307, 151167, 18194, '<td valign="top">The colors seem over saturated to me and the highlights are pretty blown out.</td>', 'The colors seem over saturated to me and the highlights are pretty blown out.', '2005-03-04 20:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208312, 151375, 24642, '<td valign="top">Not really a light toned subject but anyway a good photograph.  Interesting reflection and the position of the bird really works well just above the visible ripples of the water.  -6</td>', 'Not really a light toned subject but anyway a good photograph.  Interesting reflection and the position of the bird really works well just above the visible ripples of the water.  -6', '2005-03-04 20:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208313, 151856, 18194, '<td valign="top">The focus is very soft on this photo and the background is pretty dark making it not look all that white.</td>', 'The focus is very soft on this photo and the background is pretty dark making it not look all that white.', '2005-03-04 20:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208325, 150335, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like witty titles such as this one.  I don''t know if the cord really adds to the photo, I somehow feel that it is too dark for the tonal balance of the shot.</td>', 'I like witty titles such as this one.  I don''t know if the cord really adds to the photo, I somehow feel that it is too dark for the tonal balance of the shot.', '2005-03-04 20:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208328, 151686, 18194, '<td valign="top">I am not sure the grain look is really working here, at least not for me. The background looks pretty pink.</td>', 'I am not sure the grain look is really working here, at least not for me. The background looks pretty pink.', '2005-03-04 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208335, 150527, 18194, '<td valign="top">It is really hard to make our what we are looking at here, I assume a golf ball from the title but I have to say I am a bit lost on this one.</td>', 'It is really hard to make our what we are looking at here, I assume a golf ball from the title but I have to say I am a bit lost on this one.', '2005-03-04 20:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208346, 150678, 32902, '<td valign="top">What an adorable baby! My humble idea would be to have a little "twinkle" in the eyes- otherwise cute as a bug.</td>', 'What an adorable baby! My humble idea would be to have a little "twinkle" in the eyes- otherwise cute as a bug.', '2005-03-04 20:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208349, 151450, 18194, '<td valign="top">I assume we are looking at a reflection off a car hood, an interesting idea but the end result is not a photo that I find very appealing.</td>', 'I assume we are looking at a reflection off a car hood, an interesting idea but the end result is not a photo that I find very appealing.', '2005-03-04 20:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208353, 150535, 24642, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very good here.  The child has the focus on the thing that counts at the moment.  The cropping feels a bit to tight IMO.<br/>A fresh approach to the challenge.  -7</td>', 'The lighting is very good here.  The child has the focus on the thing that counts at the moment.  The cropping feels a bit to tight IMO.A fresh approach to the challenge.  -7', '2005-03-04 20:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208357, 151357, 32902, '<td valign="top">I think you need to set the white balance and the exposure. . . great idea though. . .</td>', 'I think you need to set the white balance and the exposure. . . great idea though. . .', '2005-03-04 20:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208362, 150434, 24642, '<td valign="top">A village in the woods?</td>', 'A village in the woods?', '2005-03-04 20:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208372, 151827, 24642, '<td valign="top">The light on the snow is beautiful and the position of the snowboarder is good.<br/>A clockwise rotation, say about 4° would help because the trees don''t feel right.  I even wonder if the image would be stronger without the trees.  -5</td>', 'The light on the snow is beautiful and the position of the snowboarder is good.A clockwise rotation, say about 4° would help because the trees don''t feel right.  I even wonder if the image would be stronger without the trees.  -5', '2005-03-04 20:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208378, 151392, 24642, '<td valign="top">The colours seem bright, not light to me.  This feels too flat for my taste -4</td>', 'The colours seem bright, not light to me.  This feels too flat for my taste -4', '2005-03-04 20:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208381, 151849, 24642, '<td valign="top">This might benefit from some more contrast.</td>', 'This might benefit from some more contrast.', '2005-03-04 20:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208389, 150483, 24642, '<td valign="top">Cool subject</td>', 'Cool subject', '2005-03-04 20:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208392, 150346, 17081, '<td valign="top">I think this has a great deal of potential - would love to see you go beyond what the basic rules will allow you to do just to see where it will take you.</td>', 'I think this has a great deal of potential - would love to see you go beyond what the basic rules will allow you to do just to see where it will take you.', '2005-03-04 20:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
