(1208486, 150363, 25232, '<td valign="top">White? not much of it in the background. The trees seem a little low contrast.</td>', 'White? not much of it in the background. The trees seem a little low contrast.', '2005-03-04 21:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208487, 151568, 25232, '<td valign="top">A bit too yellow. 8</td>', 'A bit too yellow. 8', '2005-03-04 21:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208488, 150597, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice candid looking shot.  Like the compostion, very well exposed, super job!!(Model reminds me of John Stamos, during his Full House days)</td>', 'Very nice candid looking shot.  Like the compostion, very well exposed, super job!!(Model reminds me of John Stamos, during his Full House days)', '2005-03-04 21:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208491, 151394, 6600, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes, nice composition and exposure, appears very innocent (yet looks she just got caught doing something).  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Lovely eyes, nice composition and exposure, appears very innocent (yet looks she just got caught doing something).  Very nicely done!', '2005-03-04 21:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208494, 150556, 34069, '<td valign="top">Flowers look great.  I wish the window frame wasn''t quite so bright but excellent overall.</td>', 'Flowers look great.  I wish the window frame wasn''t quite so bright but excellent overall.', '2005-03-04 21:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208495, 150966, 25232, '<td valign="top">I was just going to go eat. That''s nasty.</td>', 'I was just going to go eat. That''s nasty.', '2005-03-04 21:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208498, 151809, 25232, '<td valign="top">Leveling this would have done much for the image.</td>', 'Leveling this would have done much for the image.', '2005-03-04 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208500, 150588, 34069, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a lot of eggs in this challenge but this is my favorite egg shot.  I like how it looks as if they all are "facing" the light.  How did you get them to stand up?</td>', 'I''ve seen a lot of eggs in this challenge but this is my favorite egg shot.  I like how it looks as if they all are "facing" the light.  How did you get them to stand up?', '2005-03-04 21:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208504, 151326, 34069, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred a little more space around the ball.  Otherwise I like it.</td>', 'I would have preferred a little more space around the ball.  Otherwise I like it.', '2005-03-04 21:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208508, 150162, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure and detail.  (Devon Rex?... My neighbors have one and it appears similar.)  Great animal portrait!  (these can be hard to pull off)</td>', 'Very nice exposure and detail.  (Devon Rex?... My neighbors have one and it appears similar.)  Great animal portrait!  (these can be hard to pull off)', '2005-03-04 21:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208509, 151826, 34069, '<td valign="top">There''s not really a subject in front of the background but the photo looks good.</td>', 'There''s not really a subject in front of the background but the photo looks good.', '2005-03-04 21:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208510, 151830, 18008, '<td valign="top">Oversharpened.</td>', 'Oversharpened.', '2005-03-04 21:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208514, 150763, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and expose portrait.  Super job!  (the eyelashes distract a tad)</td>', 'Nicely composed and expose portrait.  Super job!  (the eyelashes distract a tad)', '2005-03-04 21:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208519, 150317, 34069, '<td valign="top">There were many light bulbs in this challenge but this one is the most creative.  The shadow makes the shot for me.  I also like that I can actually see all edges of the bulb.</td>', 'There were many light bulbs in this challenge but this one is the most creative.  The shadow makes the shot for me.  I also like that I can actually see all edges of the bulb.', '2005-03-04 21:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208523, 150794, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very clean, simple, and effective.  Nicely exposed and composed.  Great job.  (tint is a tad ''off-white'' but still works for me)</td>', 'Very clean, simple, and effective.  Nicely exposed and composed.  Great job.  (tint is a tad ''off-white'' but still works for me)', '2005-03-04 21:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208524, 150982, 18008, '<td valign="top">Unnecessary lightening.</td>', 'Unnecessary lightening.', '2005-03-04 21:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208527, 149790, 34069, '<td valign="top">Nice.  A refreshing breath of non-whiteness, but you still managed to meet the challenge and not overexpose the golf ball.</td>', 'Nice.  A refreshing breath of non-whiteness, but you still managed to meet the challenge and not overexpose the golf ball.', '2005-03-04 21:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208528, 151760, 6600, '<td valign="top">Creative idea!  Very well done, super job!</td>', 'Creative idea!  Very well done, super job!', '2005-03-04 21:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208532, 151375, 6600, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2005-03-04 21:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208534, 151826, 6600, '<td valign="top">Like the textures and tones, well composed and exposed.  Great job!</td>', 'Like the textures and tones, well composed and exposed.  Great job!', '2005-03-04 21:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208536, 151827, 34069, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.  It would like to see more detail in the subject''s face but I guess if the sun was on that side then you wouldn''t have the cool backlighting on the snow.</td>', 'Nice catch.  It would like to see more detail in the subject''s face but I guess if the sun was on that side then you wouldn''t have the cool backlighting on the snow.', '2005-03-04 21:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208539, 151837, 34069, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  I would''ve put the little dimples on the balls on the other side where you couldn''t see them.  Then again maybe that would expose a seam or something else on the other side.</td>', 'I like this one.  I would''ve put the little dimples on the balls on the other side where you couldn''t see them.  Then again maybe that would expose a seam or something else on the other side.', '2005-03-04 22:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208541, 150291, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, composition works, border is a ''bit much'' in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice detail, composition works, border is a ''bit much'' in my opinion.', '2005-03-04 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208543, 150526, 34069, '<td valign="top">A bit of distracting noise in the shadow.  Maybe another light to the left side would have helped to fill it in.</td>', 'A bit of distracting noise in the shadow.  Maybe another light to the left side would have helped to fill it in.', '2005-03-04 22:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208546, 151370, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture (and zoom, I presume), nicely composed and exposed.  Super!</td>', 'Very nice capture (and zoom, I presume), nicely composed and exposed.  Super!', '2005-03-04 22:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208547, 150054, 34069, '<td valign="top">Good job on the exposure but this is a rather mundane subject.</td>', 'Good job on the exposure but this is a rather mundane subject.', '2005-03-04 22:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208548, 151851, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image, but the white balance is off.  Regardless, it''s above average.  If you use photoshop, you can trust that the eyedropper tool in levels will create a pure white highlight.  The trick is finding the lightest point in the image to apply the eyedropper.  If the resulting image looks wrong, check your monitor calibration.</td>', 'Very pretty image, but the white balance is off.  Regardless, it''s above average.  If you use photoshop, you can trust that the eyedropper tool in levels will create a pure white highlight.  The trick is finding the lightest point in the image to apply the eyedropper.  If the resulting image looks wrong, check your monitor calibration.', '2005-03-04 22:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208552, 151437, 34069, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the thing, whatever it is, to be a little sharper, but I like this concept.</td>', 'I would prefer the thing, whatever it is, to be a little sharper, but I like this concept.', '2005-03-04 22:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208554, 151820, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed, good composition, great dof.  Good job!</td>', 'Nicely exposed, good composition, great dof.  Good job!', '2005-03-04 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208557, 151795, 34069, '<td valign="top">I think it would work better if the figures were on the right side.  As it is, I tend to follow the dog''s gaze off the edge of the image.  Nice job on the exposure.</td>', 'I think it would work better if the figures were on the right side.  As it is, I tend to follow the dog''s gaze off the edge of the image.  Nice job on the exposure.', '2005-03-04 22:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208559, 151435, 18008, '<td valign="top">Would be better without border.</td>', 'Would be better without border.', '2005-03-04 22:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208563, 151830, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit, but perhaps a little heavy on the sharpening.</td>', 'Very nicely lit, but perhaps a little heavy on the sharpening.', '2005-03-04 22:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208564, 151737, 34069, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the guitar completely fades into the background on the top.  Otherwise this is a cool shot.</td>', 'I don''t like that the guitar completely fades into the background on the top.  Otherwise this is a cool shot.', '2005-03-04 22:10:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1208567, 150525, 34069, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I''m saying this after so many eyeball-searing photos, but I think this one would be better if it were brighter.</td>', 'I can''t believe I''m saying this after so many eyeball-searing photos, but I think this one would be better if it were brighter.', '2005-03-04 22:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208575, 149764, 34069, '<td valign="top">The flowere turned out very well.  I would have cropped off the bottom  so you couldn''t see the line where the floor meets the wall.</td>', 'The flowere turned out very well.  I would have cropped off the bottom  so you couldn''t see the line where the floor meets the wall.', '2005-03-04 22:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208578, 151395, 18868, '<td valign="top">Over spilt portland cement?</td>', 'Over spilt portland cement?', '2005-03-04 22:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208582, 149995, 34069, '<td valign="top">This might be neat to try shooting from straight above, and then show the photo in a vertical orientation.  How did you make it light up?</td>', 'This might be neat to try shooting from straight above, and then show the photo in a vertical orientation.  How did you make it light up?', '2005-03-04 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208586, 151312, 18868, '<td valign="top">more DOF would be better with this image.</td>', 'more DOF would be better with this image.', '2005-03-04 22:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208589, 150712, 34069, '<td valign="top">Cool photo but not really any light subject in front of the white background.</td>', 'Cool photo but not really any light subject in front of the white background.', '2005-03-04 22:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208594, 151873, 34069, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but I wouldn''t call the subject "lightt".</td>', 'I like this photo but I wouldn''t call the subject "lightt".', '2005-03-04 22:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208597, 150618, 18868, '<td valign="top">Using either the indoor white balance or the custom white balance setting on your camera will help tremendously.</td>', 'Using either the indoor white balance or the custom white balance setting on your camera will help tremendously.', '2005-03-04 22:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208598, 151835, 34069, '<td valign="top">I think the wrinkles in the sheet detract from the photo.  Pressing it might help.</td>', 'I think the wrinkles in the sheet detract from the photo.  Pressing it might help.', '2005-03-04 22:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208601, 151167, 34069, '<td valign="top">I like this idea but I think the colors are just too jacked up.</td>', 'I like this idea but I think the colors are just too jacked up.', '2005-03-04 22:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208604, 151723, 34069, '<td valign="top">Wish the seeds were a little sharper.</td>', 'Wish the seeds were a little sharper.', '2005-03-04 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208606, 151435, 18868, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition.  a tad less exposure would have been just right.</td>', 'Really nice composition.  a tad less exposure would have been just right.', '2005-03-04 22:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208607, 151394, 34069, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this one the more I like it.</td>', 'The more I look at this one the more I like it.', '2005-03-04 22:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208613, 151457, 18868, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, appropriate DOF, well executed.  I expect to see you in the top 20.</td>', 'Nice composition, appropriate DOF, well executed.  I expect to see you in the top 20.', '2005-03-04 22:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1208637, 151826, 18868, '<td valign="top">Welcome to the top 20.</td>', 'Welcome to the top 20.', '2005-03-04 22:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
