(1209390, 151457, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and luminescence on the pearls which are in nice contrast to the matted fabric surface of the shoes - great shoes, by the way! :) I like the line of the ribbon, pearls and front shoe. I think I would take away the shoe in the background because it breaks the curvy flow.</td>', 'Nice lighting and luminescence on the pearls which are in nice contrast to the matted fabric surface of the shoes - great shoes, by the way! :) I like the line of the ribbon, pearls and front shoe. I think I would take away the shoe in the background because it breaks the curvy flow.', '2005-03-05 13:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
