(1209475, 151031, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the color of the snow, and nice highlights and mounding. I also like the color of the border with the shells. Nice touch. My only preference would be to have added one more shell, or taken one of these away. Odd numbers tend to strike a better balance. Even so, I like this picture a lot. Very soothing.</td>', 'Love the color of the snow, and nice highlights and mounding. I also like the color of the border with the shells. Nice touch. My only preference would be to have added one more shell, or taken one of these away. Odd numbers tend to strike a better balance. Even so, I like this picture a lot. Very soothing.', '2005-03-05 14:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
