(1209520, 150464, 33408, '<td valign="top">Such a cute dog. Animal pictures always get it good from me because they are so innocent and cute, and will do anything for a treat. Good picture</td>', 'Such a cute dog. Animal pictures always get it good from me because they are so innocent and cute, and will do anything for a treat. Good picture', '2005-03-05 15:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209523, 151700, 33947, '<td valign="top">Meets the light on white challenge, but there''s something incongruent and disappointing about artificial flowers in nature. Doesn''t work for me. That said, it sure is nice and sharp, and if it were taken indoors, I would have liked it much more.</td>', 'Meets the light on white challenge, but there''s something incongruent and disappointing about artificial flowers in nature. Doesn''t work for me. That said, it sure is nice and sharp, and if it were taken indoors, I would have liked it much more.', '2005-03-05 15:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
