(1209528, 150357, 33408, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite pictures in this challenge. the duck is so cute and innocent. i dont know how you got it to stay in that same place, that must of took a lot of skill. good picture</td>', 'This is one of my favorite pictures in this challenge. the duck is so cute and innocent. i dont know how you got it to stay in that same place, that must of took a lot of skill. good picture', '2005-03-05 15:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
