(1209761, 151133, 24642, '<td valign="top">The lighting does not feel right, perhaps because it''s coming from behind the subject.  I know that snow is very tricky for digital cameras to handle.  The snow in this shot looks right but the bulp has a dull purple cast.  I think the composition might improove by including the whole hole in the bulb.</td>', 'The lighting does not feel right, perhaps because it''s coming from behind the subject.  I know that snow is very tricky for digital cameras to handle.  The snow in this shot looks right but the bulp has a dull purple cast.  I think the composition might improove by including the whole hole in the bulb.', '2005-03-05 20:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209764, 151732, 24642, '<td valign="top">I like this minimalistic composition.  There is some trouble with the background, I can see swirls and digital noise in the background. The cause of the noise and swirls could  be some part of the post processing or the compression.  I guess that it''s the high compression.  This file is only 6Kb and my guess for a decent quality you would need at least a  60kb file.<br/>-6<br/></td>', 'I like this minimalistic composition.  There is some trouble with the background, I can see swirls and digital noise in the background. The cause of the noise and swirls could  be some part of the post processing or the compression.  I guess that it''s the high compression.  This file is only 6Kb and my guess for a decent quality you would need at least a  60kb file.-6', '2005-03-05 20:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209767, 151826, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good viewpoint and nice balance in the composition. -6</td>', 'Good viewpoint and nice balance in the composition. -6', '2005-03-05 20:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
