(1209822, 151621, 31319, '<td valign="top">Fits the light (radiance) or light (faint, pastel color of the glow beneath) on white criteria of the challenge perfectly.  A perfect 10.</td>', 'Fits the light (radiance) or light (faint, pastel color of the glow beneath) on white criteria of the challenge perfectly.  A perfect 10.', '2005-03-05 21:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209828, 151759, 31319, '<td valign="top">The title captured me to open up the thumbnail;  I''m glad I did.  The satin glows a little hotly in the lower left and the unavoidable luster on the pearls is a tad too hot, too, but the composition, textures and sentiment won it a 9 from me.  By the way, best wishes!  ::smile::</td>', 'The title captured me to open up the thumbnail;  I''m glad I did.  The satin glows a little hotly in the lower left and the unavoidable luster on the pearls is a tad too hot, too, but the composition, textures and sentiment won it a 9 from me.  By the way, best wishes!  ::smile::', '2005-03-05 21:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209829, 151394, 34600, '<td valign="top">fantastic</td>', 'fantastic', '2005-03-05 21:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209831, 151822, 31319, '<td valign="top">Exquisite tonal range and  the centralized composition works marvelously.  A 10.</td>', 'Exquisite tonal range and  the centralized composition works marvelously.  A 10.', '2005-03-05 21:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209838, 151695, 31319, '<td valign="top">The textures won this a very favorable rating from me.  The slight stain on the the feather vanes in the lower right was a tad bothersome but not enough to hurt the overall technical and compositional image.  An eight.  Save this one for another competitive format where cloning is allowed so you cna clean up the vanes and the dark spots on the rachis.  I am confident it would do well.  Good luck.</td>', 'The textures won this a very favorable rating from me.  The slight stain on the the feather vanes in the lower right was a tad bothersome but not enough to hurt the overall technical and compositional image.  An eight.  Save this one for another competitive format where cloning is allowed so you cna clean up the vanes and the dark spots on the rachis.  I am confident it would do well.  Good luck.', '2005-03-05 21:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1209840, 150588, 31319, '<td valign="top">Perfectedly balanced - pun intended - in composition and tonal range.  A 10.</td>', 'Perfectedly balanced - pun intended - in composition and tonal range.  A 10.', '2005-03-05 21:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
