(1210689, 151646, 6306, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The use of the umbrella lends an air of mystery to the photo. The only problem I have with this image is that some highlights are blown out. You get a 9 from me.</td>', 'Great composition. The use of the umbrella lends an air of mystery to the photo. The only problem I have with this image is that some highlights are blown out. You get a 9 from me.', '2005-03-06 17:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1210699, 150763, 6306, '<td valign="top">Wow.  This is one to study.  I wish I could create a portrait like this.  The only problem I have with this is that we can''t see her right eye. I think if she moved her hair slightly, the image would get a 10 vote from me.  As it stands, a 9. <br/> <br/>Hmm...on second thought, I rank this a 10, but I hope you take my advice in the future. For portraits like this, the eyes are the key.</td>', 'Wow.  This is one to study.  I wish I could create a portrait like this.  The only problem I have with this is that we can''t see her right eye. I think if she moved her hair slightly, the image would get a 10 vote from me.  As it stands, a 9.  Hmm...on second thought, I rank this a 10, but I hope you take my advice in the future. For portraits like this, the eyes are the key.', '2005-03-06 17:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1210765, 151843, 11241, '<td valign="top">looks like to much neat image used</td>', 'looks like to much neat image used', '2005-03-06 18:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
