(1211327, 150346, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea and title.  Nicely composed and exposed.  Super!</td>', 'Very creative idea and title.  Nicely composed and exposed.  Super!', '2005-03-06 23:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211329, 149974, 6600, '<td valign="top">Very cute and well done.</td>', 'Very cute and well done.', '2005-03-06 23:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211330, 151728, 6600, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed, good composition.  Great job.</td>', 'Nicely exposed, good composition.  Great job.', '2005-03-06 23:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211334, 150493, 6600, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple, effective.  Great job!</td>', 'Clean, simple, effective.  Great job!', '2005-03-06 23:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211352, 150180, 25787, '<td valign="top">Don''t quite understand the title.  Other than that I like the photo.  The tilt is pleasing, the blue tint is nice.  The composition is very good.  I wish the surface to the right of the lid was blurred like the rest of the surface.  It almost seems to make the lid float in air.</td>', 'Don''t quite understand the title.  Other than that I like the photo.  The tilt is pleasing, the blue tint is nice.  The composition is very good.  I wish the surface to the right of the lid was blurred like the rest of the surface.  It almost seems to make the lid float in air.', '2005-03-06 23:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211363, 151856, 25787, '<td valign="top">A bit too soft for my taste.  Good composition.</td>', 'A bit too soft for my taste.  Good composition.', '2005-03-06 23:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211620, 149694, 32769, '<td valign="top">great ideas<br/></td>', 'great ideas', '2005-03-07 01:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211663, 150296, 34116, '<td valign="top">I really like your use of light.  The blend between circular and linear lines is great.   This is my favorite of the competition.  Good luck, I hope you win.</td>', 'I really like your use of light.  The blend between circular and linear lines is great.   This is my favorite of the competition.  Good luck, I hope you win.', '2005-03-07 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211666, 151413, 34116, '<td valign="top">I really like the feel of this one.  The overlooking woman adds greate contrast to the other wise extremely light picture.</td>', 'I really like the feel of this one.  The overlooking woman adds greate contrast to the other wise extremely light picture.', '2005-03-07 02:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211671, 151707, 34116, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection of light on the snow.  The only thing I think would have been better would be to not show the cd at all.  But then it may have been too plain.  Overall, I like what you''ve done.</td>', 'I really like the reflection of light on the snow.  The only thing I think would have been better would be to not show the cd at all.  But then it may have been too plain.  Overall, I like what you''ve done.', '2005-03-07 02:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211674, 151566, 34116, '<td valign="top">I like it.  I really like light on snow.  It''s so natural (even if you didn''t use natural lighting, which I can''t tell either way).</td>', 'I like it.  I really like light on snow.  It''s so natural (even if you didn''t use natural lighting, which I can''t tell either way).', '2005-03-07 02:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211675, 151254, 34116, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Very linear.</td>', 'Nice.  Very linear.', '2005-03-07 02:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211679, 151822, 34116, '<td valign="top">I like the shadows.  With white on white, you use of light really makes the shot.</td>', 'I like the shadows.  With white on white, you use of light really makes the shot.', '2005-03-07 02:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211682, 151806, 34116, '<td valign="top">This picture is a bit surreal.  I can''t exactly figure out what''s going on, and I like it.  I love the pink in there, it really doesn''t make sense, and I can''t stop looking at it.</td>', 'This picture is a bit surreal.  I can''t exactly figure out what''s going on, and I like it.  I love the pink in there, it really doesn''t make sense, and I can''t stop looking at it.', '2005-03-07 02:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211689, 151591, 34116, '<td valign="top">I really like the orange red color as an offset to the white.  great find.</td>', 'I really like the orange red color as an offset to the white.  great find.', '2005-03-07 02:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211690, 151395, 34116, '<td valign="top">This image is disturbing.  I like it.</td>', 'This image is disturbing.  I like it.', '2005-03-07 02:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211691, 151862, 34116, '<td valign="top">Her white face really freaks me out.  I like it.</td>', 'Her white face really freaks me out.  I like it.', '2005-03-07 02:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211739, 151303, 31742, '<td valign="top">soooo cute!!! poor birdy he''s cold!</td>', 'soooo cute!!! poor birdy he''s cold!', '2005-03-07 02:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211765, 150075, 15420, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt at the challenge.  The date in the image is a little distracting, but I LOVE the idea! I can see you''ve used a flash in this shot because there is slight shadows behind the rolls.  If you feel adventurous, try setting up some lighting around your shot using maybe a lamp or natural lighting from a window, that might give the shot an interesting feel.  Nice work</td>', 'Nice attempt at the challenge.  The date in the image is a little distracting, but I LOVE the idea! I can see you''ve used a flash in this shot because there is slight shadows behind the rolls.  If you feel adventurous, try setting up some lighting around your shot using maybe a lamp or natural lighting from a window, that might give the shot an interesting feel.  Nice work', '2005-03-07 03:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211766, 149882, 15420, '<td valign="top">Well done.  An all round pleasing image.  I can''t help but want to see a larger version of this photo though.  I could have worked well as a 640x535 sized image?</td>', 'Well done.  An all round pleasing image.  I can''t help but want to see a larger version of this photo though.  I could have worked well as a 640x535 sized image?', '2005-03-07 03:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211767, 150363, 15420, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately Im having trouble making the connection between "Light On White" and this photograph.  It IS however a nice photograph :)</td>', 'Unfortunately Im having trouble making the connection between "Light On White" and this photograph.  It IS however a nice photograph :)', '2005-03-07 03:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211768, 150241, 15420, '<td valign="top">It reminds me of urine! LOL, great shot and great exposure keeping the background so clean</td>', 'It reminds me of urine! LOL, great shot and great exposure keeping the background so clean', '2005-03-07 03:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211769, 151367, 15420, '<td valign="top">Great exposure.  The image meets the challenge perfectly, but I kinda feel like the shot could have a little more contrast (lighter lights, and darker darks) and more of a white feel to the snow.  Nice work</td>', 'Great exposure.  The image meets the challenge perfectly, but I kinda feel like the shot could have a little more contrast (lighter lights, and darker darks) and more of a white feel to the snow.  Nice work', '2005-03-07 03:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211771, 151712, 15420, '<td valign="top">Another literal interpretation! I love it :)  Great sharpness in the photograph.  There is however, a slight halo (white edging) across the top of the lighter. A good white light source above this shot could have given it a more white background.  But nice work!</td>', 'Another literal interpretation! I love it :)  Great sharpness in the photograph.  There is however, a slight halo (white edging) across the top of the lighter. A good white light source above this shot could have given it a more white background.  But nice work!', '2005-03-07 03:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211772, 151861, 15420, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful detail and white background.  You really got it right with either your studio, or your photoshop!  There is a little bit of dirt in the foreground that is putting me off, but its a great shot!</td>', 'Such beautiful detail and white background.  You really got it right with either your studio, or your photoshop!  There is a little bit of dirt in the foreground that is putting me off, but its a great shot!', '2005-03-07 03:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211773, 150935, 15420, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Is this photo converted to black and white? good use of the white backdrop.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Is this photo converted to black and white? good use of the white backdrop.', '2005-03-07 03:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211776, 151870, 15420, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and sharpness. The border works well on this.</td>', 'Great lighting and sharpness. The border works well on this.', '2005-03-07 03:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211778, 151434, 15420, '<td valign="top">Great idea by cropping as you did.  Try moving the backdrop (paper or cloth) further away from the subject so that its out of focus, this will mean you don''t see any texture in the white area of the photograph.  nice work</td>', 'Great idea by cropping as you did.  Try moving the backdrop (paper or cloth) further away from the subject so that its out of focus, this will mean you don''t see any texture in the white area of the photograph.  nice work', '2005-03-07 03:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211779, 151793, 15420, '<td valign="top">Great idea and really good composition.  Unfortunately I fear that you will be marked down by many because some of the highlights (eg: the subject''s Shirt) are overexposed.  The challenge guidelines stated to be mindful of this.  I like it though, good work!</td>', 'Great idea and really good composition.  Unfortunately I fear that you will be marked down by many because some of the highlights (eg: the subject''s Shirt) are overexposed.  The challenge guidelines stated to be mindful of this.  I like it though, good work!', '2005-03-07 03:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211782, 150976, 29858, '<td valign="top">This is just stunning!!!.  I would love to know how you pulled this off!!!</td>', 'This is just stunning!!!.  I would love to know how you pulled this off!!!', '2005-03-07 03:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211783, 150087, 29858, '<td valign="top">Very Creative.  Great use of white space. 9</td>', 'Very Creative.  Great use of white space. 9', '2005-03-07 03:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211785, 151841, 15420, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the flash reflection.  It adds a hint of life to an otherwise simple shot.  Would love to see a little less grey, but all-in-all - not bad :)</td>', 'Nice use of the flash reflection.  It adds a hint of life to an otherwise simple shot.  Would love to see a little less grey, but all-in-all - not bad :)', '2005-03-07 03:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211787, 151508, 15420, '<td valign="top">The shell seems to have a halo below it.  Im not sure if its a black and white or not.  Quite a good shot.</td>', 'The shell seems to have a halo below it.  Im not sure if its a black and white or not.  Quite a good shot.', '2005-03-07 03:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211799, 151834, 15420, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness and good feel with the shallow depth of field.  The backdrop has a small amount of creases in it, but if your tricky, you could tell people they are supposed to be rays of light! :D</td>', 'Great sharpness and good feel with the shallow depth of field.  The backdrop has a small amount of creases in it, but if your tricky, you could tell people they are supposed to be rays of light! :D', '2005-03-07 04:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211800, 150753, 15420, '<td valign="top">Great shot, good lighting, and nice choice of colours. A little bit more contrast might have been okay?</td>', 'Great shot, good lighting, and nice choice of colours. A little bit more contrast might have been okay?', '2005-03-07 04:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1211802, 150344, 15420, '<td valign="top">Very suss looking image.  I keep thinking this should be in the nudity gallery! LOL, well done</td>', 'Very suss looking image.  I keep thinking this should be in the nudity gallery! LOL, well done', '2005-03-07 04:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
