(1211834, 150780, 32872, '<td valign="top">Very artistic!  I like your choice of subject matter and it''s a nice composition...maybe a third parsnip would be nice!<br/></td>', 'Very artistic!  I like your choice of subject matter and it''s a nice composition...maybe a third parsnip would be nice!', '2005-03-07 04:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
