(1212966, 151841, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, a quick tip, you could of slung this thru photoshop and upped the levels a tiny bit, to make the background more white, would of also given the paperclips more pop.. Good idea but could of been post-processed a bit more.. 6<br/>(although on seconds thoughts that may of over-exposed the center part of the photo.)</td>', 'OK, a quick tip, you could of slung this thru photoshop and upped the levels a tiny bit, to make the background more white, would of also given the paperclips more pop.. Good idea but could of been post-processed a bit more.. 6(although on seconds thoughts that may of over-exposed the center part of the photo.)', '2005-03-07 14:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
