(1213915, 150753, 17507, '<td valign="top">What really hurts this image are the shadows. If you don''t have access to some kind of diffuser, a good cheap solution is to block the source of light by holding a chunk of cardboard or the like in front of the light, which makes the light very even, and increasing the exposure length.</td>', 'What really hurts this image are the shadows. If you don''t have access to some kind of diffuser, a good cheap solution is to block the source of light by holding a chunk of cardboard or the like in front of the light, which makes the light very even, and increasing the exposure length.', '2005-03-07 22:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
