(1214913, 150976, 34128, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealing photo for me.  If it were mine, I would probably crop it down a little bit to make the birds a bit larger but I do like the large white background and wouldnt want to make them too large.  It might just be my monitor but the contrast seems a tad high for my taste but it is still an excellent picture.</td>', 'This is a very appealing photo for me.  If it were mine, I would probably crop it down a little bit to make the birds a bit larger but I do like the large white background and wouldnt want to make them too large.  It might just be my monitor but the contrast seems a tad high for my taste but it is still an excellent picture.', '2005-03-08 12:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
