(1215746, 151067, 20779, '<td valign="top">I was going to give this a ten, becuase its quality as an iamge is simply stunning. However, in really considering the challenge, it specifically states that you are to use a light color and this appears to have no color to me. I am very lax on "meeting the challenge", but am actually trying to tighten up a little just so as to be fair to those who did truly meet it. Sorry.  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.</td>', 'I was going to give this a ten, becuase its quality as an iamge is simply stunning. However, in really considering the challenge, it specifically states that you are to use a light color and this appears to have no color to me. I am very lax on "meeting the challenge", but am actually trying to tighten up a little just so as to be fair to those who did truly meet it. Sorry.  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.', '2005-03-08 20:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1215748, 150794, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is one of my absolute favorite compositions in the challenge, and so extremely well done. However, I am making myself really evalute what the challenge is, and I think it is ALL about using a light color on a background of white. I only see tones of B &amp; W in this, so would feel it unjust to score it high. Sorry!  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.</td>', 'This is one of my absolute favorite compositions in the challenge, and so extremely well done. However, I am making myself really evalute what the challenge is, and I think it is ALL about using a light color on a background of white. I only see tones of B & W in this, so would feel it unjust to score it high. Sorry!  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.', '2005-03-08 20:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1215750, 150386, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is one fo the few egg pictures to meet the challenge in my opinion, because you inlcuded a light COLOR - yellow. I have to score it down just a tad for the jagginess and blotchiness coming through, in fairness to others.</td>', 'This is one fo the few egg pictures to meet the challenge in my opinion, because you inlcuded a light COLOR - yellow. I have to score it down just a tad for the jagginess and blotchiness coming through, in fairness to others.', '2005-03-08 20:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1215753, 151860, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am not one to get picky on "meeting the challenge", but have actually tried to get myself to pay more attention to it. It wouldn''t be fair to those who did include a light color in their image to score this, a B &amp; W, high. Sorry. This is a stunning image. EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.</td>', 'I am not one to get picky on "meeting the challenge", but have actually tried to get myself to pay more attention to it. It wouldn''t be fair to those who did include a light color in their image to score this, a B & W, high. Sorry. This is a stunning image. EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.', '2005-03-08 20:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1215757, 151728, 20779, '<td valign="top">Thisi s one of the most well done images of this type I have ever seen. Almost like a charcoal drawing. I hate to say this, but to be fair to those who truly met the challenge by integrating a "light color" with white, I feel I have to lower my score on your just a tad. I see a pure B &amp; W image here and the challenge was very specific regarding a light color. Sorry.  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.</td>', 'Thisi s one of the most well done images of this type I have ever seen. Almost like a charcoal drawing. I hate to say this, but to be fair to those who truly met the challenge by integrating a "light color" with white, I feel I have to lower my score on your just a tad. I see a pure B & W image here and the challenge was very specific regarding a light color. Sorry.  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.', '2005-03-08 20:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1215759, 150763, 20779, '<td valign="top">I honestly see no "light color" here and I felt that the challenge was defined by this factor. In a B &amp; W challenge, I would give this a 10!!!! I just feel that to do so right now would be unjust to the people who "met" the challenge.  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.</td>', 'I honestly see no "light color" here and I felt that the challenge was defined by this factor. In a B & W challenge, I would give this a 10!!!! I just feel that to do so right now would be unjust to the people who "met" the challenge.  EDIT: after so much variance in the interpretation of the challenge, I am coming back through and this time judging on photogrpahic quality only, and not if it meets the challenge within reason. Bumping up.', '2005-03-08 20:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
