(1216136, 151728, 5112, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, they''re all much appreciated.  Basic editing is a pain, and I''m sorry I couldn''t edit out the "splotches" (clean the sensor, Ursula).<br/> <br/>Also, for those who were looking for colour, the bottle is an icky green, he, he, and the picture looks absolutely terrible in colour.  Couldn''t find a different bottle, and this is a last minute picture.  So ... in spite of the description, I went with B/W.  Grey is a colour, you know :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-09 00:38:54.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments, they''re all much appreciated.  Basic editing is a pain, and I''m sorry I couldn''t edit out the "splotches" (clean the sensor, Ursula). Also, for those who were looking for colour, the bottle is an icky green, he, he, and the picture looks absolutely terrible in colour.  Couldn''t find a different bottle, and this is a last minute picture.  So ... in spite of the description, I went with B/W.  Grey is a colour, you know :)', '2005-03-09 00:07:16.000000', '2005-03-09 00:38:54.000000', 0),
