(1216144, 149790, 33515, '<td valign="top">I am glad this challenge is over. I have received so many nice comments on this photo. I really like it and think it was one of the best, but I didnt stick to the letter of the challenge and the low votes show that. I didnt join DPC to win challenges, I joined to step my up my game and I will. Thanks to every one for your comments and votes and a big thank you to the person who selected this photo as one of their favorites, my first.<br/> <br/>155/427, I''ll take it,<br/>John Todd<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-10 08:53:19.</i></td>', 'I am glad this challenge is over. I have received so many nice comments on this photo. I really like it and think it was one of the best, but I didnt stick to the letter of the challenge and the low votes show that. I didnt join DPC to win challenges, I joined to step my up my game and I will. Thanks to every one for your comments and votes and a big thank you to the person who selected this photo as one of their favorites, my first. 155/427, I''ll take it,John Todd', '2005-03-09 00:09:10.000000', '2005-03-10 08:53:19.000000', 0),
