(1216777, 150794, 24961, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments. I just wanted to clear that I had WHITE objects on a WHITE background. I added a bit of toning because I thought that white on white wold be not so accepted here but I was wrong. Actually I am again disappointed of some people unability to see wide. According to them the pure white square, an ooposite to Malewitch''s "Black square",  would be a perfect match - everything white and no BW. But it is my humble oppinion.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments. I just wanted to clear that I had WHITE objects on a WHITE background. I added a bit of toning because I thought that white on white wold be not so accepted here but I was wrong. Actually I am again disappointed of some people unability to see wide. According to them the pure white square, an ooposite to Malewitch''s "Black square",  would be a perfect match - everything white and no BW. But it is my humble oppinion.', '2005-03-09 03:42:09.000000', NULL, 0),
