(1217061, 149882, 29269, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Lisa on your best placement so far. Keep up the good work, keep that shutter clicking and the improvement will happen.<br/> <br/>-S.</td>', 'Congratulations Lisa on your best placement so far. Keep up the good work, keep that shutter clicking and the improvement will happen. -S.', '2005-03-09 07:45:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217064, 150619, 24099, '<td valign="top">Well now I know what not to do.  This was a stretch for me as I usually<br/>do dark backgrounds.  I hope this challenge comes around again so I can<br/>apply what I learned.  I would like to thank those folks who left comments<br/>and please feel free to leave more.  We''re here to teach and learn, right?<br/> <br/>Thanks,</td>', 'Well now I know what not to do.  This was a stretch for me as I usuallydo dark backgrounds.  I hope this challenge comes around again so I canapply what I learned.  I would like to thank those folks who left commentsand please feel free to leave more.  We''re here to teach and learn, right? Thanks,', '2005-03-09 07:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
