(1217138, 150125, 19035, '<td valign="top">18 - 1''s, 20 - 2''s and 49 - 3''s, boy do I feel shitty about this score, more comments would have been helpful, I realize now that I need to recalibrate my monitor, I didnt relaize this shot was so yellow until I saw it on another few monitors at work, even so, I don''t think I deserved so many 1''s.....ugh.</td>', '18 - 1''s, 20 - 2''s and 49 - 3''s, boy do I feel shitty about this score, more comments would have been helpful, I realize now that I need to recalibrate my monitor, I didnt relaize this shot was so yellow until I saw it on another few monitors at work, even so, I don''t think I deserved so many 1''s.....ugh.', '2005-03-09 08:38:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217149, 150976, 32378, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue.</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue.', '2005-03-09 08:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217170, 150743, 12253, '<td valign="top">This has a good feel overall, and exposure and sharpness are good.  To me the composition does not have good aesthetics due to the strong presence of the stems and where they end at the top.  Subjectively, my brain sees that part of the picture is missing, more strongly than it sees a nice shot of the glass with some color balance.<br/> <br/>I am tempted to say that if you cut the shot at the top of the vase to crop most of the neck out it might work better, but there are downsides to that as well.  <br/> <br/>The above analysis may just be my own tastes, but since you asked for comments, there they are for your consideration.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This has a good feel overall, and exposure and sharpness are good.  To me the composition does not have good aesthetics due to the strong presence of the stems and where they end at the top.  Subjectively, my brain sees that part of the picture is missing, more strongly than it sees a nice shot of the glass with some color balance. I am tempted to say that if you cut the shot at the top of the vase to crop most of the neck out it might work better, but there are downsides to that as well.   The above analysis may just be my own tastes, but since you asked for comments, there they are for your consideration. ', '2005-03-09 08:56:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217176, 150782, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think this is very well done, one of the better entries in the challenge.  I think the "lower" average isn''t an issue of 1''s and 2''s--the distribution is quite normal for here, and it has a strong mean at 5.  I think the scoring issue is simply DPC tastes.  The image lacks the pop or subject twist that is popular here.  For what it''s worth, I gave it a 7; to me the dark solid border detracks from it''s delicate pastel tones and the composition could have been a bit stronger.</td>', 'I think this is very well done, one of the better entries in the challenge.  I think the "lower" average isn''t an issue of 1''s and 2''s--the distribution is quite normal for here, and it has a strong mean at 5.  I think the scoring issue is simply DPC tastes.  The image lacks the pop or subject twist that is popular here.  For what it''s worth, I gave it a 7; to me the dark solid border detracks from it''s delicate pastel tones and the composition could have been a bit stronger.', '2005-03-09 09:02:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217185, 151858, 10402, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by SimonBergink:</b></div><hr/><i> great use of the starfruit! nice white and good on you for using a different fruit. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>These are apple slices. But starfruit slices would make an interesting photo; I''ll have to try it sometime...</td>', 'Originally posted by SimonBergink: great use of the starfruit! nice white and good on you for using a different fruit.   These are apple slices. But starfruit slices would make an interesting photo; I''ll have to try it sometime...', '2005-03-09 09:08:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217189, 151375, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this shot, arty!  you rock! :)</td>', 'i love this shot, arty!  you rock! :)', '2005-03-09 09:11:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1217196, 150720, 25218, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to comment on this before the challenge ended, but I am disappointed that this did not score higher. I think it''s a beautiful photo &amp; very tactile - I feel like I can reach out &amp; pluck those blossoms right off the linen! The little bits of pink are perfect, and as for the fringe in the right hand corner, I see some commented that it''s distracting, but I think it''s a nice echo of the main composition line, and adds to the delicacy of the photo.</td>', 'I didn''t get to comment on this before the challenge ended, but I am disappointed that this did not score higher. I think it''s a beautiful photo & very tactile - I feel like I can reach out & pluck those blossoms right off the linen! The little bits of pink are perfect, and as for the fringe in the right hand corner, I see some commented that it''s distracting, but I think it''s a nice echo of the main composition line, and adds to the delicacy of the photo.', '2005-03-09 09:18:16.000000', NULL, 0),
