(1217507, 151372, 24512, '<td valign="top">Hello all and thanks for all the votes and helpfull comments on this my first entry after hanging out a while and watching from the wings.  For those of you who asked, the picture was taken at Niagara Falls, Ontario Canada.  Thank you to all who correctly commented on the greens and magentas.  between overedoing it with levels and color"mis"mangement thats why most of them are there.  however the water and the ice did have a natual greenish tinge and there was some color in the mist and falls from the sunlight...but yes...the colors were off.  thank you to those that noticed enought to comment they shouldn''t be there, and also thank you to those that liked them or liked the picture in spite of them.</td>', 'Hello all and thanks for all the votes and helpfull comments on this my first entry after hanging out a while and watching from the wings.  For those of you who asked, the picture was taken at Niagara Falls, Ontario Canada.  Thank you to all who correctly commented on the greens and magentas.  between overedoing it with levels and color"mis"mangement thats why most of them are there.  however the water and the ice did have a natual greenish tinge and there was some color in the mist and falls from the sunlight...but yes...the colors were off.  thank you to those that noticed enought to comment they shouldn''t be there, and also thank you to those that liked them or liked the picture in spite of them.', '2005-03-09 12:11:02.000000', NULL, 0),
