(1248862, 151411, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting high contrast composition which approaches a poster like effect. I like it because it has that graphical look and its artistic expression. It is not an image that may be appreciated by many simply because most people get lost looking for the missing tones rather then the intended effect. Good job.</td>', 'This is a very interesting high contrast composition which approaches a poster like effect. I like it because it has that graphical look and its artistic expression. It is not an image that may be appreciated by many simply because most people get lost looking for the missing tones rather then the intended effect. Good job.', '2005-03-25 00:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
