(1273049, 151318, 11895, '<td valign="top">Pretty darn good for a first outing with a new cam.  Getting exposure correct on snow is difficult, and you''ve done it almost perfectly here.</td>', 'Pretty darn good for a first outing with a new cam.  Getting exposure correct on snow is difficult, and you''ve done it almost perfectly here.', '2005-04-05 21:33:09.000000', NULL, 0),
