(1296040, 150717, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is such a cute shot! I wonder if could''ve been a bit more sharp around your daughter''s hair and legs - about at the same level as the dishes? That''s just picky, though. This is a really, really well-composed (and cropped :-) photograph.</td>', 'This is such a cute shot! I wonder if could''ve been a bit more sharp around your daughter''s hair and legs - about at the same level as the dishes? That''s just picky, though. This is a really, really well-composed (and cropped :-) photograph.', '2005-04-16 11:00:15.000000', NULL, 0),
