(1312001, 151062, 6306, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by arnit:</b></div><hr/><i> You should find a name for you pictures. It is not that hard. And you probably would have done better if the picture was in focus. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Arnit,<br/> <br/>I agree, there should be better focus in this image.  However, I do like the composition. As for the name, well, that''s the photographer''s choice. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-21 20:53:52.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by arnit: You should find a name for you pictures. It is not that hard. And you probably would have done better if the picture was in focus.   Arnit, I agree, there should be better focus in this image.  However, I do like the composition. As for the name, well, that''s the photographer''s choice. :)', '2005-04-21 21:53:07.000000', '2005-04-21 21:53:52.000000', 0),
