(1336440, 151846, 18450, '<td valign="top">What a good dog!! Mine runs round, trying to find smelly things to roll in when she''s had a bath. Lovely shot, I really like that direct look in her eyes, and the tongue adds a special touch.</td>', 'What a good dog!! Mine runs round, trying to find smelly things to roll in when she''s had a bath. Lovely shot, I really like that direct look in her eyes, and the tongue adds a special touch.', '2005-04-28 03:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1347291, 151869, 35235, '<td valign="top">just because your camera can produce fairly nice pictures at ISO 1600 dosn''t mean you should use it all the time.  I can see the noise in the image, if you had settled for ISO 400 It would have turned out better.  There is no excuse for a shutter speed of 5,000 unless you are shooting fallling water.  A shutter of 600 will do just fine especialy with the sucsessive shooting capability of i think 40 pictures??<br/> <br/>For how nice your equipment is you should be taking better photos.</td>', 'just because your camera can produce fairly nice pictures at ISO 1600 dosn''t mean you should use it all the time.  I can see the noise in the image, if you had settled for ISO 400 It would have turned out better.  There is no excuse for a shutter speed of 5,000 unless you are shooting fallling water.  A shutter of 600 will do just fine especialy with the sucsessive shooting capability of i think 40 pictures?? For how nice your equipment is you should be taking better photos.', '2005-04-30 18:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(1350083, 150527, 26414, '<td valign="top">sorry all :) yeah, its way too bright :p my bad.</td>', 'sorry all :) yeah, its way too bright :p my bad.', '2005-05-01 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 0),
