(1397569, 150162, 31443, '<td valign="top">Tungsten is absolutely beautiful, lucky me to see your thread. And no you are now on the receiving end of a lot of genuine affection and always honest attitude, not at all on the dark side :)</td>', 'Tungsten is absolutely beautiful, lucky me to see your thread. And no you are now on the receiving end of a lot of genuine affection and always honest attitude, not at all on the dark side :)', '2005-05-19 08:19:49.000000', NULL, 0),
