(1398497, 151479, 37961, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The clarity of the Queen and the frostiness of the other peices is lovely. Well done.</td>', 'I really like this. The clarity of the Queen and the frostiness of the other peices is lovely. Well done.', '2005-05-19 14:42:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(1399165, 151375, 23680, '<td valign="top">I didn''t comment on this challenge, but gave you a 10.  This was one of my favorites, I remember it well.  I like the black and white, the lighting, and the way the water just fades away into the background.  Good use of negative space.  I wouldn''t change anything at all about this one</td>', 'I didn''t comment on this challenge, but gave you a 10.  This was one of my favorites, I remember it well.  I like the black and white, the lighting, and the way the water just fades away into the background.  Good use of negative space.  I wouldn''t change anything at all about this one', '2005-05-19 19:15:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(1412979, 151674, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice study however, the larger DPC voting block is simply stunted when confronted with artistic renditions. The ethereal feel of this image escapes them because they are trying to find the focus point. They know that these images exists, they just do not see them. They prefer them in paintings. lol</td>', 'This is a very nice study however, the larger DPC voting block is simply stunted when confronted with artistic renditions. The ethereal feel of this image escapes them because they are trying to find the focus point. They know that these images exists, they just do not see them. They prefer them in paintings. lol', '2005-05-26 00:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(1413159, 151275, 27440, '<td valign="top">The overexposed part was done while shooting. In ps the contrast and levels have been slightly altered and that''s why the overexposure is even stronger</td>', 'The overexposed part was done while shooting. In ps the contrast and levels have been slightly altered and that''s why the overexposure is even stronger', '2005-05-26 04:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1423173, 150556, 35161, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! All the colors work well together! Love the texture of the window in the bg! Very, very nice! :)</td>', 'Wonderful shot! All the colors work well together! Love the texture of the window in the bg! Very, very nice! :)', '2005-05-31 13:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1436331, 150259, 19746, '<td valign="top">Those strays make the best pets!  I have a complete mongrel of a dog and it''s probably the most affectionate, loyal and perpetually grateful pooch I could ever hope to have.  Excellent animal portrait and congratulations on your top 10!<br/> <br/>Alex.</td>', 'Those strays make the best pets!  I have a complete mongrel of a dog and it''s probably the most affectionate, loyal and perpetually grateful pooch I could ever hope to have.  Excellent animal portrait and congratulations on your top 10! Alex.', '2005-06-06 10:04:10.000000', NULL, 0),
